 your account and personally identifiable information (PII) that is stored on our system. You will receive an email to verify your request. Once the request is verified we will take care of deleting your PII. If you just want to check what PII we have stored, you can <a href="/request-data" rel="noopener noreferrer">request your data</a>.</p></div>': '<div class="ql-editor read-mode"><p>提交删除账户及系统存储的个人身份信息（PII）的请求。您将收到验证请求的邮件。请求通过验证后，我们将处理您的PII删除事宜。若仅需查看我们存储的PII内容，您可以<a href="/request-data" rel="noopener noreferrer">申请获取数据</a>。</p></div>', '<div class="well">\n    Edit list of Series in the box. Rules:\n    <ul>\n        <li>Each Series Prefix on a new line.</li>\n        <li>Allowed special characters are "/" and "-"</li>\n        <li>\n            Optionally, set the number of digits in the series using dot (.)\n            followed by hashes (#). For example, ".####" means that the series\n            will have four digits. Default is five digits.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            You can also use variables in the series name by putting them\n            between (.) dots\n            <br>\n            Supported Variables:\n            <ul>\n                <li><code>.YYYY.</code> - Year in 4 digits</li>\n                <li><code>.YY.</code> - Year in 2 digits</li>\n                <li><code>.MM.</code> - Month</li>\n                <li><code>.DD.</code> - Day of month</li>\n                <li><code>.WW.</code> - Week of the year</li>\n                <li>\n                    <code>.{fieldname}.</code> - fieldname on the document e.g.\n                    <code>branch</code>\n                </li>\n                <li><code>.FY.</code> - Fiscal Year (requires ERPNext to be installed)</li>\n                <li><code>.ABBR.</code> - Company Abbreviation (requires ERPNext to be installed)</li>\n            </ul>\n        </li>\n    </ul>\n    Examples:\n    <ul>\n        <li>INV-</li>\n        <li>INV-10-</li>\n        <li>INVK-</li>\n        <li>INV-.YYYY.-.{branch}.-.MM.-.####</li>\n    </ul>\n</div>\n<br>\n': '<div class="well">\n    在框中编辑系列列表。规则：\n    <ul>\n        <li>每个系列前缀占一行。</li>\n        <li>允许的特殊字符为“/”和“-”</li>\n        <li>\n            可选地，使用点 (.)\n            后跟井号 (#) 来设置系列中的位数。例如，“.####”表示系列\n            将有四位数字。默认值为五位数字。\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            您还可以在系列名称中使用变量，方法是将它们放在\n            (.) 点之间\n            <br>\n            支持的变量：\n            <ul>\n                <li><code>.YYYY。</code> - 4 位数字的年份</li>\n                <li><code>.YY。</code> - 2 位数字的年份</li>\n                <li><code>.MM.</code> - 月份</li>\n                <li><code>.DD.</code> - 月份中的日期</li>\n                <li><code>.WW.</code> - 一年中的周数</li>\n                <li><code>.FY.</code> - 财政年度</li>\n                <li><code>.ABBR.</code> - 公司缩写</li>\n                <li>\n                    <code>.{fieldname}.</code> - 文档上的字段名称，例如\n                    <code>分支</code>\n                </li>\n            </ul>\n        </li>\n    </ul>\n    示例：\n    <ul>\n        <li>INV-</li>\n        <li>INV-10-</li>\n        <li>INVK-</li>\n        <li>INV-.YYYY.-.{branch}.-.MM.-.####</li>\n    </ul>\n</div>\n<br>\n', '<h3>Custom CSS Help</h3>\n\n<p>Notes:</p>\n\n<ol>\n<li>All field groups (label + value) are set attributes <code>data-fieldtype</code> and <code>data-fieldname</code></li>\n<li>All values are given class <code>value</code></li>\n<li>All Section Breaks are given class <code>section-break</code></li>\n<li>All Column Breaks are given class <code>column-break</code></li>\n</ol>\n\n<h4>Examples</h4>\n\n<p>1. Left align integers</p>\n\n<pre><code>[data-fieldtype="Int"] .value { text-align: left; }</code></pre>\n\n<p>1. Add border to sections except the last section</p>\n\n<pre><code>.section-break { padding: 30px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; }\n.section-break:last-child { padding-bottom: 0px; border-bottom: 0px;  }</code></pre>\n': '<h3>自定义 CSS 帮助</h3>\n\n<p>注释：</p>\n\n<ol>\n<li>所有字段组(标签 + 值)都设置了属性<code>data-fieldtype</code>和<code>data-fieldname</code></li>\n<li>所有值都有类<code>value</code></li>\n<li>所有分隔段均为<code>section-break</code>类</li>\n<li>所有分隔列均为<code>column-break</code>类</li>\n</ol>\n\n<h4>示例</h4>\n\n<p>1.左对齐整数</p>\n\n<pre><code>[data-fieldtype="Int"] .value { text-align: left; }</code></pre>\n\n<p>1.为除最后一节外的各节添加边框</p>\n\n<pre><code>.section-break { padding：30px 0px; border-bottom：1px solid #eee; }\n.section-break:last-child { padding-bottom：0px; border-bottom：0px; }</code></pre>\n', '<h3>Print Format Help</h3>\n<hr>\n<h4>Introduction</h4>\n<p>Print Formats are rendered on the server side using the Jinja Templating Language. All forms have access to the <code>doc</code> object which contains information about the document that is being formatted. You can also access common utilities via the <code>frappe</code> module.</p>\n<p>For styling, the Boostrap CSS framework is provided and you can enjoy the full range of classes.</p>\n<hr>\n<h4>References</h4>\n<ol>\n\t<li><a href="http://jinja.pocoo.org/docs/templates/" target="_blank">Jinja Templating Language</a></li>\n\t<li><a href="http://getbootstrap.com" target="_blank">Bootstrap CSS Framework</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h4>Example</h4>\n<pre><code>&lt;h3&gt;{{ doc.select_print_heading or "Invoice" }}&lt;/h3&gt;\n&lt;div class="row"&gt;\n\t&lt;div class="col-md-3 text-right"&gt;Customer Name&lt;/div&gt;\n\t&lt;div class="col-md-9"&gt;{{ doc.customer_name }}&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;div class="row"&gt;\n\t&lt;div class="col-md-3 text-right"&gt;Date&lt;/div&gt;\n\t&lt;div class="col-md-9"&gt;{{ doc.get_formatted("invoice_date") }}&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;table class="table table-bordered"&gt;\n\t&lt;tbody&gt;\n\t\t&lt;tr&gt;\n\t\t\t&lt;th&gt;Sr&lt;/th&gt;\n\t\t\t&lt;th&gt;Item Name&lt;/th&gt;\n\t\t\t&lt;th&gt;Description&lt;/th&gt;\n\t\t\t&lt;th class="text-right"&gt;Qty&lt;/th&gt;\n\t\t\t&lt;th class="text-right"&gt;Rate&lt;/th&gt;\n\t\t\t&lt;th class="text-right"&gt;Amount&lt;/th&gt;\n\t\t&lt;/tr&gt;\n\t\t{%- for row in doc.items -%}\n\t\t&lt;tr&gt;\n\t\t\t&lt;td style="width: 3%;"&gt;{{ row.idx }}&lt;/td&gt;\n\t\t\t&lt;td style="width: 20%;"&gt;\n\t\t\t\t{{ row.item_name }}\n\t\t\t\t{% if row.item_code != row.item_name -%}\n\t\t\t\t&lt;br&gt;Item Code: {{ row.item_code}}\n\t\t\t\t{%- endif %}\n\t\t\t&lt;/td&gt;\n\t\t\t&lt;td style="width: 37%;"&gt;\n\t\t\t\t&lt;div style="border: 0px;"&gt;{{ row.description }}&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n\t\t\t&lt;td style="width: 10%; text-align: right;"&gt;{{ row.qty }} {{ row.uom or row.stock_uom }}&lt;/td&gt;\n\t\t\t&lt;td style="width: 15%; text-align: right;"&gt;{{\n\t\t\t\trow.get_formatted("rate", doc) }}&lt;/td&gt;\n\t\t\t&lt;td style="width: 15%; text-align: right;"&gt;{{\n\t\t\t\trow.get_formatted("amount", doc) }}&lt;/td&gt;\n\t\t&lt;/tr&gt;\n\t\t{%- endfor -%}\n\t&lt;/tbody&gt;\n&lt;/table&gt;</code></pre>\n<hr>\n<h4>Common Functions</h4>\n<table class="table table-bordered">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style="width: 30%;"><code>doc.get_formatted("[fieldname]", [parent_doc])</code></td>\n\t\t\t<td>Get document value formatted as Date, Currency, etc. Pass parent <code>doc</code> for currency type fields.</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style="width: 30%;"><code>frappe.db.get_value("[doctype]", "[name]", "fieldname")</code></td>\n\t\t\t<td>Get value from another document.</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n': '<h3>打印格式帮助</h3>\n<hr>\n<h4>简介</h4>\n<p>打印格式是使用 Jinja 模板语言在服务器端渲染的。所有表单都可以访问<code>doc</code>对象，该对象包含正在格式化的文档的相关信息。你还可以通过<code>frappe</code>模块访问常用工具。</p>\n<p>在样式设计方面，我们提供了 Boostrap CSS 框架，你可以使用全部的类。</p>\n<hr>\n<h4>参考资料</h4>\n<ol>\n\t<li><a href="http://jinja.pocoo.org/docs/templates/" target="_blank">Jinja 模板语言</a></li>\n\t<li><a href="http://getbootstrap.com" target="_blank">Bootstrap CSS 框架</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h4>示例</h4>\n<pre><code>&lt;h3&gt;{{ doc.select_print_heading or "Invoice" }}&lt;/h3&gt;\n&lt;div class="row"&gt;\n\t&lt;div class="col-md-3 text-right"&gt;客户姓名&lt;/div&gt;\n\t&lt;div class="col-md-9"&gt;{{ doc.customer_name }}&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;div class="row"&gt;\n\t&lt;div class="col-md-3 text-right"&gt;Date&lt;/div&gt;\n\t&lt;div class="col-md-9"&gt;{{ doc.get_formatted("invoice_date") }}&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;table class="table table- border" trbodybordered"&gt;\n\t&lt;tbody&gt;\n\t\t&lt;tr&gt;\n\t\t\t&lt;th&gt;Sr&lt;/th&gt;\n\t\t\t&lt;th&gt;Item Name&lt;/th&gt;\n\t\t\t&lt;th&gt;Description&lt;/th&gt;\n\t\t\t&lt;th class="text- right" Qty /th th class="text- right" Qtyright"&gt;Qty&lt;/th&gt;\n\t\t\t&lt;th class="text-right"&gt;Rate&lt;/th&gt;\n\t\t\t&lt;th class="text-right"&gt;Amount&lt;/th&gt;\n\t\t&lt;/tr&gt;\n\t\t{%- for row in doc.items -%}\n\t\t&lt;tr&gt;\n\t\t\t&lt;td style="width：3%;"&gt;{{ row.idx }}&lt;/td&gt;\n\t\t\t&lt;td style="width: 20%;"&gt;\n\t\t\t\t{{ row.item_name }}\n\t\t\t\t{% if row.item_code != row.item_name -%}\n\t\t\t\t&lt;br&gt;项目代码： {{ row.item_code}}\n\t\t\t\t{%- endif %}\n\t\t\t&lt;/td&gt;\n\t\t\t&lt;td style="width: 37%;"&gt;\n\t\t\t\t&lt;div style="border：0px;"&gt;{{ row.description }}&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n\t\t\t&lt;td style="width: 10%; text-align: right;"&gt;{{ row.qty }} {{ row.uom or row.stock_uom }}&lt;/td&gt;\n\t\t\t&lt;td style="width: 15%; text-align: right;"&gt;{{\n\t\t\t\trow.get_formatted("rate", doc) }}&lt;/td&gt;\n\t\t\t&lt;td style="width: 15%; text-align: right;"&gt;{{\n\t\t\t\trow.get_formatted("amount", doc) }}&lt;/td&gt;\n\t\t&lt;/tr&gt;\n\t\t{%- endfor -%}\n\t&lt;/tbody&gt;\n&lt;/table&gt;</code></pre>\n<hr>\n<h4>常用函数</h4>\n<table class="table table-bordered">\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style="width: 30%;"><code>doc.get_formatted("[fieldname]", [parent_doc])</code></td>\n\t\t\t<td>获取格式为日期、货币等的文档值。对于货币类型字段，请传递父<code>doc</code>。</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td style="width: 30%;"><code>frappe.db.get_value("[doctype]", "[name]", "fieldname")</code></td>\n\t\t\t<td>从另一个文档获取值。</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n', '<h4>Default Template</h4>\n<p>Uses <a href="http://jinja.pocoo.org/docs/templates/">Jinja Templating</a> and all the fields of Address (including Custom Fields if any) will be available</p>\n<pre><code>{{ address_line1 }}&lt;br&gt;\n{% if address_line2 %}{{ address_line2 }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n{{ city }}&lt;br&gt;\n{% if state %}{{ state }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n{% if pincode %} PIN:  {{ pincode }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n{{ country }}&lt;br&gt;\n{% if phone %}Phone: {{ phone }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n{% if fax %}Fax: {{ fax }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n{% if email_id %}Email: {{ email_id }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n</code></pre>': '<h4>默认模板</h4>\n<p>使用<a href="http://jinja.pocoo.org/docs/templates/">Jinja 模板</a>，地址的所有字段（包括自定义字段（如有））均可用</p>\n<pre><code>{{ address_line1 }}&lt;br&gt;\n{% if address_line2 %}{{ address_line2 }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n{{ city }}&lt;br&gt;\n{% if state %}{{ state }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n{% if pincode %} 密码：  {{ pincode }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n{{ country }}&lt;br&gt;\n{% if phone %}电话： {{ phone }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n{% if fax %}传真： {{ fax }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n{% if email_id %}电子邮件： {{ email_id }}&lt;br&gt;{% endif -%}\n</code></pre>', '<h4>Email Reply Example</h4>\n\n<pre>Order Overdue\n\nTransaction {{ name }} has exceeded Due Date. Please take necessary action.\n\nDetails\n\n- Customer: {{ customer }}\n- Amount: {{ grand_total }}\n</pre>\n\n<h4>How to get fieldnames</h4>\n\n<p>The fieldnames you can use in your email template are the fields in the document from which you are sending the email. You can find out the fields of any documents via Setup &gt; Customize Form View and selecting the document type (e.g. Sales Invoice)</p>\n\n<h4>Templating</h4>\n\n<p>Templates are compiled using the Jinja Templating Language. To learn more about Jinja, <a class="strong" href="http://jinja.pocoo.org/docs/dev/templates/">read this documentation.</a></p>\n': '<h4>电子邮件回复示例</h4>\n\n<pre>订单逾期\n\n交易 {{ name }} 已超过到期日。请采取必要行动。\n\n详情\n\n- 客户： {{ customer }}\n- 金额： {{ grand_total }}\n</pre>\n\n<h4>如何获取字段名</h4>\n\n<p>您可以在电子邮件模板中使用的字段名是发送电子邮件的文档中的字段。您可以通过设置 &gt; 自定义表单视图并选择文档类型（如销售发票）来查找任何文档的字段。</p>\n\n<h4>模板</h4>\n\n<p>模板使用 Jinja 模板语言编译。要了解有关 Jinja 的更多信息，请<a class="strong" href="http://jinja.pocoo.org/docs/dev/templates/">阅读此文档。</a></p>\n', '<h5 class="text-muted uppercase">Or</h5>': '<h5 class="text-muted uppercase">或者</h5>', '<h5>Message Example</h5>\n\n<pre>&lt;h3&gt;Order Overdue&lt;/h3&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;Transaction {{ doc.name }} has exceeded Due Date. Please take necessary action.&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;!-- show last comment --&gt;\n{% if comments %}\nLast comment: {{ comments[-1].comment }} by {{ comments[-1].by }}\n{% endif %}\n\n&lt;h4&gt;Details&lt;/h4&gt;\n\n&lt;ul&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Customer: {{ doc.customer }}\n&lt;li&gt;Amount: {{ doc.grand_total }}\n&lt;/ul&gt;\n</pre>': '<h5>消息范例</h5>\n\n<pre>&lt;h3&gt;订单逾期&lt;/h3&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;交易 {{ doc.name }} 已逾期. 请采取必要行动.&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;!-- 显示最新备注信息 --&gt;\n{% if comments %}\n最新备注: {{ comments[-1].comment }}  {{ comments[-1].by }}\n{% endif %}\n\n&lt;h4&gt;详情&lt;/h4&gt;\n\n&lt;ul&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;客户: {{ doc.customer }}\n&lt;li&gt;金额: {{ doc.grand_total }}\n&lt;/ul&gt;\n</pre>', '<p>Multiple webforms can be created for a single doctype. Add filters specific to this webform to display correct record after submission.</p><p>For Example:</p>\n<p>If you create a separate webform every year to capture feedback from employees add a \n field named year in doctype and add a filter <b>year = 2023</b></p>\n': '<p>可为单一类型创建多个网络表单。为该网络表单添加特定筛选器，以便在提交后显示正确的记录。</p><p>例如</p>\n<p>如果您每年都创建一个单独的网络表格来收集员工的反馈意见，请在 doctype 中添加一个名为年份的 \n 字段，并添加过滤器<b>年份 = 2023</b></p>\n', '<p>Set context before rendering a template. Example:</p><p>\n</p><div><pre><code>\ncontext.project = frappe.get_doc("Project", frappe.form_dict.name)\n</code></pre></div>': '<p>在渲染模板前设置上下文。示例</p><p>\n</p><div><pre><code>\ncontext.project = frappe.get_doc("Project", frappe.form_dict.name)\n</code></pre></div>', '<p>To interact with above HTML you will have to use `root_element` as a parent selector.</p><p>For example:</p><pre class="p-3 bg-gray-100 border-radius rounded-sm mb-0" style="width: fit-content;"><code>// here root_element is provided by default\nlet some_class_element = root_element.querySelector(\'.some-class\');\nsome_class_element.textContent = "New content";\n</code></pre>': '<p>要与上述 HTML 交互，您必须使用 `root_element` 作为父选择器。</p><p>例如：</p><pre class="p-3 bg-gray-100 border-radius rounded-sm mb-0" style="width: fit-content;"><code>// 这里默认提供 root_element\nlet some_class_element = root_element.querySelector(\'.some-class\');\nsome_class_element.textContent = "New content";\n</code></pre>', '<p>Your OTP secret on {0} has been reset. If you did not perform this reset and did not request it, please contact your System Administrator immediately.</p>': '<p>您在{0}的OTP密钥已被重置。若非您本人操作，请立即联系系统管理员。</p>', '<pre>*  *  *  *  *\n┬  ┬  ┬  ┬  ┬\n│  │  │  │  │\n│  │  │  │  └ day of week (0 - 6) (0 is Sunday)\n│  │  │  └───── month (1 - 12)\n│  │  └────────── day of month (1 - 31)\n│  └─────────────── hour (0 - 23)\n└──────────────────── minute (0 - 59)\n\n---\n\n* - Any value\n/ - Step values\n</pre>\n': '<pre>* * * * *\n┬ ┬ ┬ ┬ ┬\n│ │ │ │ │\n│ │ │ │ └ 星期几 (0 - 6)（0 为星期日）\n│ │ │ └───── 月 (1 - 12)\n│ │ └────────── 月中某天 (1 - 31)\n│ └──────────────── 小时 (0 - 23)\n└──────────────────── 分钟 (0 - 59)\n\n---\n\n* - 任意值\n/ - 步长值\n</pre>\n', '<pre><code>doc.grand_total &gt; 0</code></pre>\n\n<p>Conditions should be written in simple Python. Please use properties available in the form only.</p>\n<p>Allowed functions:\n</p><ul>\n<li>frappe.db.get_value</li>\n<li>frappe.db.get_list</li>\n<li>frappe.session</li>\n<li>frappe.utils.now_datetime</li>\n<li>frappe.utils.get_datetime</li>\n<li>frappe.utils.add_to_date</li>\n<li>frappe.utils.now</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Example: </p><pre><code>doc.creation &gt; frappe.utils.add_to_date(frappe.utils.now_datetime(), days=-5, as_string=True, as_datetime=True) </code></pre><p></p>': '<pre><code>doc.grand_total &gt; 0</code></pre>\n\n<p>条件应使用简单的 Python 语言编写。请仅使用表单中可用的属性。</p>\n<p>允许使用的函数：\n</p><ul>\n<li>frappe.db.get_value</li>\n<li>frappe.db.get_list</li>\n<li>frappe.session</li>\n<li>frappe.utils.now_datetime</li>\n<li>frappe.utils.get_datetime</li>\n<li>frappe.utils.add_too_date</li>\n<li>frappe.utils.now</li>\n</ul>\n<p>示例： </p><pre><code>doc.creation &gt; frappe.utils.add_to_date(frappe.utils.now_datetime(), days=-5, as_string=True, as_datetime=True) </code></pre><p></p>', '<span class="h2">Hi,</span>': '<span class="h2">你好、</span>', '<strong>Warning:</strong> This field is system generated and may be overwritten by a future update. Modify it using {0} instead.': '<strong>警告:</strong> 本字段为系统生成，可能被后续更新覆盖。请使用{0}进行修改。', '=': '=', '>': '>', '>=': '>=', "A DocType's name should start with a letter and can only consist of letters, numbers, spaces, underscores and hyphens": '文档类型名称应以字母开头，只能包含字母、数字、空格、下划线和连字符', 'A Frappe Framework instance can function as an OAuth Client, Resource, or Authorization server. This DocType contains settings related to all three.': 'Frappe Framework实例可作为OAuth客户端、资源服务器或授权服务器运行。本文档类型包含与此三种角色相关的设置。', 'A field with the name {0} already exists in {1}': '字段{0}已在{1}中存在', 'A file with same name {} already exists': '同名文件 {} 已存在', 'A list of resources which the Client App will have access to after the user allows it.<br> e.g. project': '资源的列表，它的客户端应用程序必须将用户允许后访问。 <br>如项目', 'A new account has been created for you at {0}.': '已为您创建新账户{0}.', 'A recurring {0} {1} has been created for you via Auto Repeat {2}.': '已通过自动重复{2}为您创建周期性{0} {1}。', 'A symbol for this currency. For e.g. $': '货币符号。例如$', 'A template already exists for field {0} of {1}': '字段{1}.{0}的模板已存在', 'A version identifier string for the client software.\n<br>\nThe value of the should change on any update of the client software with the same Software ID.': '客户端软件的版本标识符字符串。\n<br>\n对于具有相同软件ID的客户端软件，该值应在任何更新时变更。', 'A word by itself is easy to guess.': '很容易猜到的一个字', 'A0': 'A0', 'A1': 'A1', 'A2': 'A2', 'A3': 'A3', 'A4': 'A4', 'A5': 'A5', 'A6': 'A6', 'A7': 'A7', 'A8': 'A8', 'A9': 'A9', 'ALL': '全部', 'API': 'API', 'API Access': 'API访问', 'API Endpoint': 'API端点', 'API Endpoint Args': 'API端点参数', 'API Endpoint Args should be valid JSON': 'API端点参数应为有效的JSON格式', 'API Key': 'API密钥', 'API Key and Secret to interact with the relay server. These will be auto-generated when the first push notification is sent from any of the apps installed on this site.': '与中继服务器交互的API密钥和密钥。当从本站点安装的任何应用发送第一条推送通知时自动生成。', 'API Key cannot be regenerated': '无法重新生成API密钥', 'API Keys': 'API密钥', 'API Logging': 'API日志记录', 'API Method': 'API方法', 'API Request Log': 'API请求日志', 'API Secret': 'API密钥', 'ASC': '升序', 'About': '关于', 'About Us': '关于我们', 'About Us Settings': '关于我们设置', 'About Us Team Member': '关于我们 团队成员', 'About {0} minute remaining': '剩余约{0}分钟', 'About {0} minutes remaining': '剩余约{0}分钟', 'About {0} seconds remaining': '剩余约{0}秒', 'Accept Invitation': '接受邀请', 'Accepted': '已接受', 'Accepted At': '接受时间', 'Access Control': '访问控制', 'Access Log': '访问记录', 'Access Token': '访问令牌', 'Access Token URL': '访问令牌URL', 'Access not allowed from this IP Address': '禁止从此IP地址访问', 'Account': '科目', 'Account Deletion Settings': '账号删除设置', 'Accounts Manager': '会计经理', 'Accounts User': '会计', 'Accurate count can not be fetched, click here to view all documents': '无法获取准确计数，点击此处查看所有文档', 'Action': '操作', 'Action / Route': '操作 / 网址路径', 'Action Complete': '操作完成', 'Action Failed': '操作失败', 'Action Label': '操作标签', 'Action Timeout (Seconds)': '操作超时（秒）', 'Action Type': '操作类型', 'Action {0} completed successfully on {1} {2}. View it {3}': '操作{0}在{2} {1}上成功完成。查看{3}', 'Action {0} failed on {1} {2}. View it {3}': '操作{0}在{2} {1}上失败。查看{3}', 'Actions': '操作', 'Activate': '激活', 'Active': '激活', 'Active Directory': 'Active Directory', 'Active Domains': '已启用的行业', 'Active Sessions': '活动会话', 'Activity': '活动', 'Activity Log': '用户操作日志', 'Add': '添加', 'Add / Remove Columns': '添加/移除列', 'Add / Update': '添加/更新', 'Add A New Rule': '创建新规则', 'Add Attachment': '添加附件', 'Add Background Image': '添加背景图片', 'Add Border at Bott