ity whose property is to be set': '拟被设定属性的记录ID(名称)', 'IDs must contain only alphanumeric characters, not contain spaces, and should be unique.': '标识符须为唯一字母数字组合，不含空格', 'IMAP Details': 'IMAP详情', 'IMAP Folder': '收件箱目录', 'IMAP Folder Not Found': '未找到收件箱目录', 'IMAP Folder Validation Failed': '收件箱目录验证失败', 'IMAP Folder name cannot be empty.': '收件箱目录名称不能为空。', 'IP Address': 'IP地址', 'Icon': '图标', 'Icon Image': '图标图片', 'Icon Style': '图标样式', 'Icon Type': '图标类型', 'Icon is not correctly configured please check the workspace sidebar to it': '图标配置不正确，请检查工作区侧边栏进行修正', 'Icon will appear on the button': '图标将显示在按钮上', 'Identity Details': '身份信息', 'Idx': '序号', 'If Apply Strict User Permission is checked and User Permission is defined for a DocType for a User, then all the documents where value of the link is blank, will not be shown to that User': '如果勾选了“加严用户权限限制”，并为用户定义了“用户权限限制”，则该链接字段值为空的所有单据将不会显示给该用户', 'If Checked workflow status will not override status in list view': '如勾选，工作流状态不会覆盖列表视图中的状态字段', 'If Owner': '是制单人？', 'If a Role does not have access at Level 0, then higher levels are meaningless.': '如果角色没有0级的访问权限，那么无需设置更高级权限', 'If checked, a confirmation will be required before performing workflow actions.': '若勾选，执行工作流操作前将需要确认。', 'If checked, all other workflows become inactive.': '如果勾选，本单据类型其他工作流将变为失效状态。', 'If checked, negative numeric values of Currency, Quantity or Count would be shown as positive': '勾选后货币/数量/计数的负值显示为正值', 'If checked, users will not see the Confirm Access dialog.': '如果选中，用户将不会看到确认访问对话框。', 'If disabled, this role will be removed from all users.': '如果禁用了，这个角色将会从所有用户中删除。', 'If enabled,  user can login from any IP Address using Two Factor Auth, this can also be set for all users in System Settings': '如果启用，用户从任何IP地址登录都需要双重验证，可以在系统设置中为所有用户启用双重验证', 'If enabled, all responses on the web form will be submitted anonymously': '启用后Web表单提交将匿名处理', 'If enabled, all users can login from any IP Address using Two Factor Auth. This can also be set only for specific user(s) in User Page': '如果启用，所有用户都可以使用双因素身份验证从任何IP地址登录。这也可以只为用户页面中的特定用户设置', 'If enabled, changes to the document are tracked and shown in timeline': '如果启用，对单据的变更会被追踪记录，显示在表单下方的日志记录里', 'If enabled, document views are tracked, this can happen multiple times': '如果启用，系统会记录单据被查看过多少次', "If enabled, only System Managers can upload public files. Other users can't see the checkbox <i>Is Private</i> in the upload dialog.": '如果启用，只有系统管理员可以上传公共文件。其他用户在上传对话框中看不到 <i>私有？</i> 复选框。', 'If enabled, the document is marked as seen, the first time a user opens it': '如果启用，用户第一次打开单据，系统就会记录单据被查看过', 'If enabled, the notification will show up in the notifications dropdown on the top right corner of the navigation bar.': '如勾选，通知将出现在导航区右上角的通知清单里', 'If enabled, the password strength will be enforced based on the Minimum Password Score value. A value of 1 being very weak and 4 being very strong.': '若启用，系统将根据最小密码评分值强制执行密码强度（注：1分表示极弱，4分表示极强）。', "If enabled, users who login from Restricted IP Address, won't be prompted for Two Factor Auth": '如果启用，从受限制IP地址登录的用户无需双重验证', 'If enabled, users will be notified every time they login. If not enabled, users will only be notified once.': '如勾选，用户每次登录时都弹框通知。否则只弹框通知一次。', 'If left empty, the default workspace will be the last visited workspace': '如果不勾选，默认工作区为最后一次访问的工作区', 'If no Print Format is selected, the default template for this report will be used.': '如果未选择打印格式，将使用此报表的默认模板。', 'If non standard port (e.g. 587)': '如果为非标准端口（如587）', 'If non standard port (e.g. 587). If on Google Cloud, try port 2525.': '如果非标准端口（例如587）。如果在Google Cloud上，请尝试使用端口2525。', 'If non-standard port (e.g. POP3: 995/110, IMAP: 993/143)': '如使用非标端口 (如. POP3: 995/110, IMAP: 993/143)', 'If not set, the currency precision will depend on number format': '如果未设置，则货币精度将取决于数字格式', 'If set, only user with these roles can access this chart. If not set, DocType or Report permissions will be used.': '如勾选则仅限分派了这些角色的用户可看到本图表，否则由单据类型或报表权限控制图表是否显示', 'If the user has any role checked, then the user becomes a "System User". "System User" has access to the desktop': '如果用户检查了任何角色，则该用户将成为“系统用户”。 “系统用户”可以访问桌面', 'If these instructions where not helpful, please add in your suggestions on GitHub Issues.': '如果这些说明没有帮助，请在Github提交你的建议。', 'If this email is registered with us, we have sent password reset instructions to it. Please check your inbox.': '如果此邮箱已在我们这里注册，我们已向其发送了密码重置说明。请检查您的收件箱。', 'If this was a mistake or you need access again, please reach out to your team.': '若此为误操作或您需要重新获取访问权限，请联系您的团队。', 'If unchecked, the value will always be re-fetched on save.': '如不勾选则每次保存单据时都刷新本字段值', 'If user is the owner': '仅限创建者', 'If you are updating, please select "Overwrite" else existing rows will not be deleted.': '如果你的操作是更新，请选择“覆盖”否则现有的行不会删除。', 'If you are uploading new records, "Naming Series" becomes mandatory, if present.': '上传新纪录时，如果有单据编号模板字段，那么“单据编号模板”必须填写。', 'If you are uploading new records, leave the "name" (ID) column blank.': '如果你在上传新纪录，那么单据编号(ID)列必须留空。', 'If you have any questions, reach out to your system administrator.': '如有任何疑问，请联系系统管理员。', 'If you have recently restored the site, you may need to copy the site_config.json containing the original encryption key.': '若近期恢复站点，需复制包含原始密钥的site_config.json文件', 'If you set this, this Item will come in a drop-down under the selected parent.': '如果维护此上级菜单信息，本菜单项仅作为下级菜单。', 'If you think this is unauthorized, please change the Administrator password.': '如认为未经授权，请修改管理员密码', 'If your CSV uses a different delimiter, add that character here, ensuring no spaces or additional characters are included.': '如果CSV文件使用了逗号，分号与跳格之外的其它分隔符，请在上述输入框添加，请不要加空格和其它字符', 'If your data is in HTML, please copy paste the exact HTML code with the tags.': '如果你的数据是HTML，请复制粘贴的标签准确的HTML代码。', 'Ignore User Permissions': '忽略用户权限限制', 'Ignore XSS Filter': '忽略XSS过滤条件', 'Ignore attachments over this size': '忽略超过此大小的附件', 'Ignored Apps': '忽略的应用', 'Illegal Document Status for {0}': '{0}非法单据状态', 'Illegal SQL Query': '非法SQL查询', 'Illegal template': '非法模板', 'Image': '图片', 'Image Field': '图片字段', 'Image Height (px)