.com/apis/credentials">\n"API &amp; Services" &gt; "Credentials"\n</a>下的 Google Cloud Console 获取的浏览器 API 密钥', 'The changes have been reverted.': '更改已还原。', 'The column {0} has {1} different date formats. Automatically setting {2} as the default format as it is the most common. Please change other values in this column to this format.': '列{0}存在{1}种日期格式。自动将最常见的{2}设为默认格式。请将此列其他值更改为该格式。', 'The comment cannot be empty': '评论内容不能为空', 'The configured SMTP server does not support DSN (Delivery Status Notification).': '已配置的 SMTP 服务器不支持 DSN（投递状态通知）。', 'The contents of this email are strictly confidential. Please do not forward this email to anyone.': '此邮件内容严格保密。请勿转发给任何人。', 'The count shown is an estimated count. Click here to see the accurate count.': '显示数量为估算值。点击此处查看精确数量。', "The country's ISO 3166 ALPHA-2 code.": '国家ISO 3166 ALPHA-2代码。', 'The document could not be correctly assigned': '无法正确分派单据', 'The document has been assigned to {0}': '该单据已分派给{0}', 'The document type selected is a child table, so the parent document type is required.': '所选文档类型为子表，需指定父文档类型。', 'The field {0} in {1} does not allow ignoring user permissions': '字段 {0} 在 {1} 中不允许忽略用户权限', 'The field {0} in {1} links to {2} and not {3}': '字段 {0} 在 {1} 中链接到 {2} 而不是 {3}', "The fieldname you've specified in Attached To Field is invalid": '在“附加到字段”中指定的字段名无效', 'The following Assignment Days have been repeated: {0}': '以下分配日期重复：{0}', "The following Header Script will add the current date to an element in 'Header HTML' with class 'header-content'": "以下页眉脚本将当前日期添加至类名为'header-content'的页眉HTML元素中", 'The following configured IMAP folder(s) were not found or are not accessible on the server:<br><ul>{0}</ul>Please verify the folder names exactly as they appear on the server and ensure the account has access to them.': '以下已配置的 IMAP 收件箱目录在服务器上未找到或无法访问：<br><ul>{0}</ul>请验证目录名称与服务器上显示的完全一致，并确保该科目有权访问它们。', 'The following values are invalid: {0}. Values must be one of {1}': '以下值无效：{0}，有效值为{1}中的一项', 'The following values do not exist for {0}: {1}': '{0}字段不存在以下值：{1}', 'The link you trying to login is invalid or expired.': '您尝试登录的链接无效或已过期。', 'The meta description is an HTML attribute that provides a brief summary of a web page. Search engines such as Google often display the meta description in search results, which can influence click-through rates.': '元描述是HTML属性，提供网页摘要。Google等搜索引擎常在搜索结果中显示元描述，影响点击率。', 'The meta image is unique image representing the content of the page. Images for this Card should be at least 280px in width, and at least 150px in height.': '元图像是代表页面内容的唯一图像。卡片图像宽度至少280px，高度至少150px。', 'The name that will appear in Google Calendar': '将显示在Google日历中的名称', 'The next tour will start from where the user left off.': '下次导览将从用户上次结束处开始。', 'The number of seconds until the request expires': '请求逾期时间(秒)', 'The process for deletion of {0} data associated with {1} has been initiated.': '删除与{1}关联的{0}数据的过程已启动。', 'The project number obtained from Google Cloud Console under <a href="https://console.cloud.google.com/iam-admin/settings">\n"IAM &amp; Admin" &gt; "Settings"\n</a>': '从<a href="https://console.cloud.google.com/iam-admin/settings">\n"IAM &amp; Admin" &gt; "Settings"\n</a>下的 Google Cloud Console 获取的项目编号', "The report you requested has been generated.<br><br>Click here to download:<br><a href='{0}'>{0}</a><br><br>This link will expire in {1} hours.": "您请求的报告已生成。<br><br>点击此处下载：<br><a href='{0}'>{0}</a><br><br>此链接将在{1}小时后过期。", 'The reset password link has been expired': '重置密码链接已过期', 'The reset password link has either been used before or is invalid': '重置密码链接已被使用或无效', 'The resource you are looking for is not available': '您正在查找的资源不可用', 'The selected document {0} is not a {1}.': '所选文档{0}不是{1}类型。', 'The system is being updated. Please refresh again after a few moments.': '系统正在更新。请稍后刷新页面。', 'The system provides many pre-defined roles. You can add new roles to set finer permissions.': '本系统提供了许多预定义角色。您可以添加新角色设定更精细的权限。', 'The value of the field {0} is too long in the {1} document. To resolve this issue, please reduce the value length or change the {0} field Type to Long Text using customize form, and then try again.': '字段 {0} 的值在单据 {1} 中过长。要解决此问题，请缩短值的长度或使用定制表单将 {0} 的字段类型更改为长文本，然后重试。', 'The value you pasted was {0} characters long. Max allowed characters is {1}.': '您粘贴的值长度为{0}个字符。最大允许字符数为{1}。', 'The webhook will be triggered if this expression is true': '当表达式为真时触发Webhook', 'The {0} is already on auto repeat {1}': '{0}已启用自动重复{1}', 'Theme': '主题', 'Theme Changed': '主题已更改', 'Theme Configuration': '主题配置', 'Theme URL': '主题网址', 'There are documents which have workflow states that do not exist in this Workflow. It is recommended that you add these states to the Workflow and change their states before removing these states.': '存在文档的工作流状态未包含在此工作流中。建议在移除前将这些状态添加至工作流并修改文档状态。', 'There are no upcoming events for you.': '你没有待处理事项', "There are no {0} for this {1}, why don't you start one!": '此{1}无{0}，何不创建一个！', 'There are {0} with the same filters already in the queue:': '队列中已有{0}条相同筛选条件的记录：', 'There can be only 9 Page Break fields in a Web Form': '网页表单最多允许9个分页符字段', 'There can be only one Fold in a form': '一个表单只能有一个折叠', 'There is an error in your Address Template {0}': '地址模板有一个错误{0}', 'There is no data to be exported': '没有可导出的数据', 'There is no task called "{}"': '不存在名为"{}"的任务', 'There is nothing new to show you right now.': '当前没有新内容显示', 'There is some problem with the file url: {0}': '有一些问题与文件的URL：{0}', 'There is {0} with the same filters already in the queue:': '队列中已有{0}条相同筛选条件的记录：', 'There must be atleast one permission rule.': '至少要一个权限规则。', 'There was an error building this page': '构建此页面时出错', 'There was an error saving filters': '保存过滤条件时出错', 'There were errors': '出错了', 'There were errors while creating the document. Please try again.': '创建单据时出错。请再试一次。', 'There were errors while sending email. Please try again.': '邮件发送失败，请重试。', 'There were some errors setting the name, please contact the administrator': '设置名称时出现错误，请与管理员联系', 'These announcements will appear inside a dismissible alert