ch might not appear in final PDF. <br> Consider saving the document before printing.': '此文档存在未保存更改，可能不会反映在最终PDF中。<br>打印前请先保存文档。', 'This document is already amended, you cannot ammend it again': '此文档已修订，不可再次修订', 'This document is currently locked and queued for execution. Please try again after some time.': '单据被后台待执行操作锁定，请稍后再试。', 'This email is autogenerated': '此电子邮件是自动生成的', 'This feature can not be used as dependencies are missing.\n\t\t\t\tPlease contact your system manager to enable this by installing pycups!': '由于缺少依赖项，该功能无法使用。\n\t\t\t\t请联系系统管理员，通过安装 pycups 来启用此功能！', 'This feature is brand new and still experimental': '此功能是全新的，仍处于试验阶段', "This field will appear only if the fieldname defined here has value OR the rules are true (examples):\nmyfield\neval:doc.myfield=='My Value'\neval:doc.age&gt;18": "本字段仅在以上代码框中定义的字段有值或表达式(js代码)结果为真时显示，如案例1：字段等于指定值；<br>\neval:doc.myfield=='my value'\n案例2：年龄大于18 <br>\neval:doc.age&gt;18", 'This file is attached to a protected document and cannot be deleted.': '该文件已关联至受保护文档，不可删除。', 'This file is public and can be accessed by anyone, even without logging in. Mark it private to limit access.': '本文件为公开文件，无需登录即可访问。请设为私有以限制访问权限。', 'This file is public. It can be accessed without authentication.': '此为公开文件，用户无需登录即可访问', 'This form has been modified after you have loaded it': '重新加载后表单就已被修改，', 'This form is not editable due to a Workflow.': '此表单因工作流状态不能被编辑。', 'This format is used if country specific format is not found': '此格式用于如果找不到特定国家的格式', 'This geolocation provider is not supported yet.': '暂不支持此地理位置服务提供商。', 'This goes above the slideshow.': '在幻灯片上面。', 'This is a background report. Please set the appropriate filters and then generate a new one.': '此报表是后台运行报表，请设置恰当的过滤条件并点击右上角生成新报表按钮获取报表结果', 'This is a top-10 common password.': '这是一个前10名的常用密码。', 'This is a top-100 common password.': '这是一个前100名的常用密码。', 'This is a very common password.': '这是一个非常普遍的密码。', 'This is a virtual doctype and data is cleared periodically.': '这是个虚拟单据，数据会被定期清理', 'This is an automatically generated reply': '这是一个自动生成的回复', 'This is similar to a commonly used password.': '这类似于一个通常使用的密码。', 'This is the number of the last created transaction with this prefix': '此流水号段(前缀)的当前流水号', 'This link has already been activated for verification.': '此链接已激活以进行验证。', 'This link is invalid or expired. Please make sure you have pasted correctly.': '此链接是无效或过期。请确保你已经正确粘贴。', 'This may get printed on multiple pages': '可能会打印多页', 'This month': '这个月', 'This report contains {0} rows and is too big to display in browser, you can {1} this report instead.': '此报告包含{0}行数据，浏览器显示过大，建议{1}此报告。', 'This report was generated on {0}': '此报表是在{0}上生成的', 'This report was generated {0}.': '报表{0}已生成。', 'This request has not yet been approved by the user.': '此请求尚未得到用户的批准。', 'This site is in read only mode, full functionality will be restored soon.': '此站点处于只读模式，完整功能将尽快恢复。', 'This site is running in developer mode. Any change made here will be updated in code.': '本站点已设置开发者模式参数，单据修改会同步到代码中', 'This software is built on top of many open source packages.': '本软件基于众多开源软件包构建。', 'This title will be used as the title of the webpage as well as in meta tags': '此标题将作为网页标题及元标签内容', "This value is fetched from {0}'s {1} field": '此值取自{0}的{1}字段', 'This value specifies the max number of rows that can be rendered in report view.': '此值指定报告视图中可渲染的最大行数。', 'This will be automatically generated when you publish the page, you can also enter a route yourself if you wish': '发布页面时将自动生成路由，也可手动输入自定义路由', 'This will be shown in a modal after routing': '路由后将显示在模态框中', 'This will be shown to the user in a dialog after routing to the report': '路由至报告后将以对话框形式向用户显示', 'This will log out {0} from all other devices': '这将从所有其他设备注销{0}', 'This will permanently remove your data.': '这将彻底删除您的数据。', 'This will reset this tour and show it to all users. Are you sure?': '将重置此导览并向所有用户显示。是否继续？', 'This will terminate the job immediately and might be dangerous, are you sure?': '此操作将立即终止任务且可能存在风险，是否确认继续？', 'Throttled': '节流', 'Thumbnail URL': '