osphere': '工程大气压', 'Technology': '技术', 'Telecommunications': '电信', 'Telephone Expenses': '电话费', 'Telephony Call Type': '电话呼叫类型', 'Television': '电视', 'Template Item': '模板物料', 'Template Item Selected': '已选模板物料', 'Template Task': '模板任务', 'Template Title': '模板标题', 'Temporarily on Hold': '已暂挂', 'Temporary': '临时', 'Temporary Accounts': '临时科目', 'Temporary Opening': '临时开账', 'Temporary Opening Account': '临时开账科目', 'Term Details': '条款信息', 'Terms': '条款', 'Terms & Conditions': '条款和条件', 'Terms Template': '条款模板', 'Terms and Conditions': '条款和条件', 'Terms and Conditions Content': '条款和条件内容', 'Terms and Conditions Details': '条款和条件信息', 'Terms and Conditions Help': '条款和条件帮助', 'Terms and Conditions Template': '条款和条件模板', 'Territory': '区域', 'Territory Item': '区域物料', 'Territory Manager': '区域经理', 'Territory Name': '区域名称', 'Territory Target Variance Based On Item Group': '分区域物料组业绩达成分析', 'Territory Targets': '区域目标', 'Territory-wise Sales': '分区域销售', 'Tesla': '特斯拉', "The 'From Package No.' field must neither be empty nor it's value less than 1.": '“From Package No.”字段不能为空，也不能小于1。', 'The Access to Request for Quotation From Portal is Disabled. To Allow Access, Enable it in Portal Settings.': '门户询价申请功能已禁用。如需启用，请在门户设置中开启', 'The BOM which will be replaced': '此物料清单将被替换', 'The Batch {0} has negative batch quantity {1}. To fix this, go to the batch and click on Recalculate Batch Qty. If the issue still persists, create an inward entry.': '批次{0}存在负批次数量{1}。要修复此问题，请前往该批次并点击“重新计算批次数量”。若问题仍存在，请创建入库凭证。', "The Campaign '{0}' already exists for the {1} '{2}'": "活动'{0}'已存在于{1}'{2}'中", 'The Document Type {0} must have a Status field to configure Service Level Agreement': '单据类型{0}必须具有状态字段以配置服务级别协议', 'The GL Entries and closing balances will be processed in the background, it can take a few minutes.': '总账分录和期末余额将在后台处理，可能需要几分钟', 'The GL Entries will be cancelled in the background, it can take a few minutes.': '总账分录将在后台取消，可能需要几分钟', "The Loyalty Program isn't valid for the selected company": '积分方案对所选公司无效', 'The Payment Request {0} is already paid, cannot process payment twice': '付款申请{0}已支付，不能重复处理', 'The Payment Term at row {0} is possibly a duplicate.': '第{0}行的支付条款可能是重复的。', 'The Pick List having Stock Reservation Entries cannot be updated. If you need to make changes, we recommend canceling the existing Stock Reservation Entries before updating the Pick List.': '存在库存预留记录的拣货清单无法更新。如需修改，建议在更新前取消现有库存预留', 'The Process Loss Qty has reset as per job cards Process Loss Qty': '已基于工单生产任务单最大制程损耗重置了制程损耗数量', 'The Sales Person is linked with {0}': '该销售员与{0}相关联', 'The Serial No at Row #{0}: {1} is not available in warehouse {2}.': '第{0}行的序列号{1}在仓库{2}中不可用', 'The Serial No {0} is reserved against the {1} {2} and cannot be used for any other transaction.': '序列号{0}已为{1}{2}预留，不能用于其他交易', "The Serial and Batch Bundle {0} is not valid for this transaction. The 'Type of Transaction' should be 'Outward' instead of 'Inward' in Serial and Batch Bundle {0}": "序列号批次组合{0}对此交易无效。在序列号批次组合{0}中，'交易类型'应为'出库'而非'入库'", "The Stock Entry of type 'Manufacture' is known as backflush. Raw materials being consumed to manufacture finished goods is known as backflushing. <br><br> When creating Manufacture Entry, raw-material items are backflushed based on BOM of production item. If you want raw-material items to be backflushed based on Material Transfer entry made against that Work Order instead, then you can set it under this field.": "'生产'类型的库存转移单称为反冲。通过消耗原材料生产成品称为反冲处理。<br><br>创建生产转移单时，原材料根据生产物料的BOM进行反冲。若希望基于工单的物料转移单进行反冲，可在此字段设置", 'The account head under Liability or Equity, in which Profit/Loss will be booked': '负债或权益下的科目，用于利润/亏损记账', 'The allocated amount is greater than the outstanding amount of Payment Request {0}': '分配金额超过付款申请{0}的未清金额', 'The amount of {0} set in this payment request is different from the calculated amount of all payment plans: {1}. Make sure this is correct before submitting the document.': '此收付款申请中设置的{0}金额与所有付款计划的计算金额不同：{1}。在提交单据之前确保这是正确的。', 'The currency of invoice {} ({}) is different from the currency of this dunning ({}).': '发票{}({})的币种与本催款单({})币种不一致', 'The current POS opening entry is outdated. Please close it and create a new one.': '当前POS期初凭证已过期。请关闭该凭证并创建新凭证。', 'The default BOM for that item will be fetched by the system. You can also change the BOM.': '系统将获取该物料的默认BOM，也可手动修改', 'The difference between from time and To Time must be a multiple of Appointment': '起止时间差必须为预约间隔的整数倍', 'The field Asset Account cannot be blank': '资产科目不能为空', 'The field Equity/Liability Account cannot be blank': '权益/负债科目不能为空', 'The field From Shareholder cannot be blank': '转出股东的字段不能为空', 'The field To Shareholder cannot be blank': '“转入股东”字段不能为空', 'The field {0} in row {1} is not set': '第{1}行的字段{0}未设置', 'The fields From Shareholder and To Shareholder cannot be blank': '转出股东和转入股东字段不能为空', 'The folio numbers are not matching': '作品集编号不匹配', 'The following Items, having Putaway Rules, could not be accomodated:': '以下存在上架规则的物料无法安置：', 'The following assets have failed to automatically post depreciation entries: {0}': '以下资产自动计提折旧失败：{0}', 'The following batches are expired, please restock them: <br> {0}': '以下批次已过期，请补货：<br>{0}', 'The following deleted attributes exist in Variants but not in the Template. You can either delete the Variants or keep the attribute(s) in template.': '以下已删除属性存在于变体但不存在于模板。请删除变体或在模板保留属性', 'The following employees are currently still reporting to {0}:': '以下员工当前仍汇报给{0}：', 'The following invalid Pricing Rules are deleted:': '以下无效定价规则已被删除：', 'The following {0} were created: {1}': '已创建以下{0}：{1}', 'The gross weight of the package. Usually net weight + packaging material weight. (for print)': '包裹总重量，通常是净重+包装材料的重量。 （用于打印）', 'The holiday on {0} is not between From Date and To Date': '在{0}这个节日之间不在开始日期和结束日期之间', 'The item {item} is not marked as {type_of} item. You can enable it as {type_of} item from its Item master.': '物料{item}未标记为{type_of}物料。可在物料主数据中启用', 'The items {0} and {1} are present in the following {2} :': '物料{0}和{1}存在于以下{2}中：', 'The items {items} are not marked as {type_of} item. You can enable them as {type_of} item from their Item masters.': '物料{items}未标记为{type_of}物料。可在各自主数据中启用', 'The job card {0} is in {1} state and you cannot complete.': '工序卡{0}处于{1}状态，无法完成', 'The job card {0} is in {1} state and you cannot start it again.': '工序卡{0}处于{1}状态，无法重新启动', "The last scanned warehouse has been cleared and won't be set in the subsequently scanned items": '最后扫描的仓库已被清除，不会设置在后续扫描的物料中', 'The lowest tier must have a minimum spent amount of 0. Customers need to be part of a tier as soon as they are enrolled in the program.': '最低层级必须设置0消费金额。客户加入计划后即属于某个层级', 'The net weight of this package. (calculated automatically as sum of net weight of items)': '包裹净重。（根据包裹内物料净重自动计算）', 'The new BOM after replacement': '替换后的物料清单', 'The number of shares and the share numbers are inconsistent': '股份数量和股票数量不一致', 'The operation {0} can not add multiple times': '操作{0}不能重复添加', 'The operation {0} can not be the sub operation': '操作{0}不能作为子工序', 'The original invoice should be consolidated before or along with the return invoice.': '原始发票应在退货发票前或同时合并', 'The parent account {0} does not exists in the uploaded template': '上传模板中父科目 {0} 不存在', 'The payment gateway account in plan {0} is different from the payment gateway account in this payment request': '计划{0}中的支付网关账户与此收付款申请中的支付网关账户不同', 'The percentage you are allowed to bill more against the amount ordered. For example, if the order value is $100 for an item and tolerance is set as 10%, then you are allowed to bill up to $110 ': '允许超出订单金额的开单百分比。例如：订单金额$100，容差设为10%，则最多可开单$110', 'The percentage you are allowed to pick more items in the pick list than the ordered quantity.': '允许超订单需求量拣货百分比', 'The percentage you are allowed to receive or deliver more against the quantity ordered. For example, if you have ordered 100 units, and your Allowance is 10%, then you are allowed to receive 110 units.': '允许超订单量出入库百分比。如，订单数量100个，容差10％，则最多可收货或发货110个', 'The percentage you are allowed to transfer more against the quantity ordered. For example, if you have ordered 100 units, and your Allowance is 10%, then you are allowed transfer 110 units.': '允许超订单需求量发料百分比。例如需求100个，最多允许超10％，则最多可发料110个', 'The reserved stock will be released when you update items. Are you certain you wish to proceed?': '更新物料时将释放预留库存。确定继续？', 'The reserved stock will be released. Are you certain you wish to proceed?': '将释放预留库存。确定继续？', 'The root account {0} must be a group': '根级科目{0}必须是组类型', 'The selected BOMs are not for the same item': '所选物料清单不能用于同一个物料', "The selected change account {} doesn't belongs to Company {}.": '所选找零账户{}不属于公司{}', 'The selected item cannot have Batch': '所选物料不能启用批号管理', 'The seller and the buyer cannot be the same': '卖方和买方不能相同', 'The serial and batch bundle {0} not linked to {1} {2}': '序列号批次组合{0}未链接到{1}{2}', 'The serial no {0} does not belong to item {1}': '序列号{0}不属于物料{1}', 'The shareholder does not belong to this company': '股东不属于这家公司', 'The shares already exist': '股份已经存在', "The shares don't exist with the {0}": '股份不存在{0}', 'The stock has been reserved for the following Items and Warehouses, un-reserve the same to {0} the Stock Reconciliation: <br /><br /> {1}': '以下物料和仓库的库存已被预留，请取消预留以{0}库存对账：<br /><br />{1}', 'The sync has started in the background, please check the {0} list for new records.': '同步已在后台启动，请查看{0}列表获取新记录', 'The system will create a Sales Invoice or a POS Invoice from the POS interface based on this setting. For high-volume transactions, it is recommended to use POS Invoice.': '系统将基于此设置从POS界面创建销售发票或POS发票。对于高流量交易，建议使用POS发票。', 'The task has been enqueued as a background job. In case there is any issue on processing in background, the system will add a comment about the error on this Stock Reconciliation and revert to the Draft stage': '该任务已被列入后台工作。如果在后台处理有任何问题，系统将在此库存对账中添加有关错误的注释，并恢复到草稿阶段', 'The task has been enqueued as a background job. In case there is any issue on processing in background, the system will add a comment about the error on this Stock Reconciliation and revert to the Submitted stage': '任务已加入