, '19:00': '19:00', '20:00': '20:00', '21:00': '21:00', '22:00': '22:00', '23:00': '23:00', '<b>Base</b> amount has not been set for the following employee(s): {0}': '<b>基本</b>金额未对以下员工设置：{0}', '<b>Example:</b> SAL-{first_name}-{date_of_birth.year} <br>This will generate a password like SAL-Jane-1972': '<b>示例：</b>SAL-{first_name}-{date_of_birth.year} <br>将生成类似SAL-Jane-1972的密码', '<b>Total Leaves Allocated</b> are more than the number of days in the allocation period': '<b>分配的总假期</b>超过分配周期天数', '<h3>Help</h3>\n\n<p>Notes:</p>\n\n<ol>\n<li>Use field <code>base</code> for using base salary of the Employee</li>\n<li>Use Salary Component abbreviations in conditions and formulas. <code>BS = Basic Salary</code></li>\n<li>Use field name for employee details in conditions and formulas. <code>Employment Type = employment_type</code><code>Branch = branch</code></li>\n<li>Use field name from Salary Slip in conditions and formulas. <code>Payment Days = payment_days</code><code>Leave without pay = leave_without_pay</code></li>\n<li>Direct Amount can also be entered based on Condition. See example 3</li></ol>\n\n<h4>Examples</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Calculating Basic Salary based on <code>base</code>\n<pre><code>Condition: base &lt; 10000</code></pre>\n<pre><code>Formula: base * .2</code></pre></li>\n<li>Calculating HRA based on Basic Salary<code>BS</code> \n<pre><code>Condition: BS &gt; 2000</code></pre>\n<pre><code>Formula: BS * .1</code></pre></li>\n<li>Calculating TDS based on Employment Type<code>employment_type</code> \n<pre><code>Condition: employment_type=="Intern"</code></pre>\n<pre><code>Amount: 1000</code></pre></li>\n</ol>': '<h3>帮助</h3>\n\n<p>注释：</p>\n\n<ol>\n<li>用字段 <code>base</code> 表示员工基本工资</li>\n<li>在条件和公式中使用工资组成部分的缩写。 <code>BS = Basic Salary</code></li>\n<li>在条件和公式中使用字段名称来显示员工详细信息。 <code>就业类型 = employment_type</code><code>分部 = branch</code></li>\n<li>在条件和公式中使用工资单中的字段名称。 <code>账期 = payment_days</code><code>无薪假期 = leave_without_pay</code></li>\n<li>也可以根据条件输入具体金额。参见示例 3</li></ol>\n\n<h4>示例</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>根据 <code>base</code> 计算基本工资\n<pre><code>条件：base &lt; 10000</code></pre>\n<pre><code>公式：base * .2</code></pre></li>\n<li>计算 HRA 基本工资 <code>BS</code>\n<pre><code>条件：BS &gt; 2000</code></pre>\n<pre><code>公式：BS * .1</code></pre></li>\n<li>计算基于 TDS 的员工类型 <code>employment_type</code> \n<pre><code>条件：employment_type=="实习"</code></pre>\n<pre><code>金额：1000</code></pre></li>\n</ol>', '<h4>Condition Examples</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Applying tax if employee born between 31-12-1937 and 01-01-1958 (Employees aged 60 to 80)<br>\n<code>Condition: date_of_birth&gt;date(1937, 12, 31) and date_of_birth&lt;date(1958, 01, 01)</code></li><br><li>Applying tax by employee gender<br>\n<code>Condition: gender=="Male"</code></li><br>\n<li>Applying tax by Salary Component<br>\n<code>Condition: base &gt; 10000</code></li></ol>': '<h4>条件示例</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>如果员工出生在 1937 年 12 月 31 日至 1958 年 1 月 1 日之间（员工年龄在 60 岁至 80 岁之间），则需纳税<br>\n<code>条件：date_of_birth&gt;date(1937, 12, 31) and date_of_birth&lt;date(1958, 01, 01)</code></li><br><li>按员工性别算税<br>\n<code>条件：gender=="男"</code></li><br>\n<li>按工资组成算税<br>\n<code>条件：base &gt; 10000</code></li></ol>', '<h5>Employees on Half Day</h5>': '<h5>半日制员工</h5>', '<h5>Unmarked Employees</h5>': '<h5>未标记员工</h5>', '<hr>': '<hr>', '<span class="h4"><b>Transactions &amp; Reports</b></span>': '<span class="h4"><b>交易 &amp; 报告</b></span>', '<span style="font-size: 18px;"><b>Masters &amp; Reports</b></span>': '<span style="font-size: 18px;"><b>雇主 &amp; 报告</b></span>', "<table class='table table-bordered'><tr><th>{0}</th><th>{1}</th></tr>": "<table class='table table-bordered'><tr><th>{0}</th><th>{1}</th></tr>", 'A Job Requisition for {0} requested by {1} already exists: {2}': '由{1}申请的{0}职位申请已存在：{2}', 'A friendly reminder of an important date for our team.': '关于团队重要日期的温馨提示', 'A {0} exists between {1} and {2} (': '在{1}至{2}期间存在{0}（', 'Absent': '缺勤', 'Absent Days': '缺勤天数', 'Absent Records': '缺勤记录', 'Account No': '账号', 'Account type should be set {0} for payroll