nts without adding them to earnings. The accrued balance is tracked in the Employee Benefit Ledger and can be paid out later as needed.': '若启用，此组件允许计提金额而不将其添加到收入中。计提余额在员工福利分类账中追踪，可根据需要后续支付。', 'If enabled, this component will be included in arrear calculations': '若启用，此组件将包含在欠薪计算中', 'If enabled, total no. of working days will include holidays, and this will reduce the value of Salary Per Day': '启用后，总工作日数将包含节假日，从而降低日薪计算值', 'If greater than zero, this sets the maximum benefit amount assignable to any employee': '若大于零，此值设置可分配给任何员工的最大福利金额', 'If not checked, the list will have to be added to each Department where it has to be applied.': '未勾选时，需手动将该列表添加至每个适用部门', "If selected, the value specified or calculated in this component will not contribute to the earnings or deductions. However, it's value can be referenced by other components that can be added or deducted. ": '选中后，该组件指定或计算的值不计入收入或扣除项，但可被其他组件引用', 'If set, the job opening will be closed automatically after this date': '设置后，该职位空缺将在该日期后自动关闭', 'If you are using loans in salary slips, please install the {0} app from Frappe Cloud Marketplace or GitHub to continue using loan integration with payroll.': '若在工资条中使用贷款功能，请从Frappe云端市场或GitHub安装{0}应用以继续使用薪资集成贷款功能。', 'Import Attendance': '导入考勤', 'In Time': '准时', 'In case of any error during this background process, the system will add a comment about the error on this Payroll Entry and revert to the Submitted status': '后台处理过程中若发生错误，系统将在薪资条目添加错误注释并恢复至已提交状态', 'Incentive': '激励', 'Incentive Amount': '激励金额', 'Include Company Descendants': '包含子公司', 'Include Holidays': '包含节假日', 'Include holidays in Total no. of Working Days': '将节假日计入总工作日数', 'Include holidays within leaves as leaves': '将包含节假日的假期视为正常假期', 'Income Source': '收入来源', 'Income Tax Amount': '所得税金额', 'Income Tax Breakup': '所得税明细', 'Income Tax Component': '所得税组件', 'Income Tax Computation': '所得税计算', 'Income Tax Deducted Till Date': '截至当前已扣所得税', 'Income Tax Deductions': '所得税扣除项', 'Income Tax Slab': '所得税税级', 'Income Tax Slab Other Charge