': '运行', 'Search by Title': '按标题搜索', 'Search by title': '按标题搜索', 'Teams': '团队', 'Upload Failed': '上传失败', 'chart': '图表', 'equals': '等于', 'folder': '文件夹', 'query': '查询', "\n\t\t\tThe Batch {0} of an item {1} has negative stock in the warehouse {2}{3}.\n\t\t\tPlease add a stock quantity of {4} to proceed with this entry.\n\t\t\tIf it is not possible to make an adjustment entry, please enable 'Allow Negative Stock for Batch' in the batch {0} or in the Stock Settings to proceed.\n\t\t\tHowever, enabling this setting may lead to negative stock in the system.\n\t\t\tSo please ensure the stock levels are adjusted as soon as possible to maintain the correct valuation rate.": '物料 {1} 的批次 {0} 在仓库 {2}{3}出现负库存。请补充 {4} 的库存数量后再继续此单据。如无法做调整单据，请在批次 {0} 或库存设置中启用「允许批次负库存」后继续。但启用此设置可能使系统出现负库存，因此请尽快调整库存，以保持成本价正确。', ' Enable this if you want the bot to be able to process files like Excel sheets or data from Insights.\n                    <br>\n                    OpenAI Assistants run code in a sandboxed environment (on OpenAI servers) to do this.': '启用后，机器人可以处理 Excel 表格、Insights 数据之类的文件。\n<br>\nOpenAI 助手会在沙盒环境中（OpenAI 服务器上）运行代码来完成这项处理。', ' Phantom Item': '虚拟件', '## Adding Users\n\nTo access Raven, users need to have the **Raven User** role.\n\nGo to the "Users" list and add the role to the users you want on Raven.': '## 添加用户\n\n用户须拥有 **Raven 用户**角色才能访问 Raven。\n\n前往“用户”列表，为需要使用 Raven 的用户添加该角色。', '## Channels\n\nRaven helps you and your team communicate with each other.\n\nConversation happen in **channels**. \n\nAll users who have access to Raven can view and send messages in **Open** channels. \n\n**Public** channels are visible to everyone, but only members can take send messages in them. Any user can join public channels. \n\n**Private** channels are only visible to members and new members can only be added by the channel admin - which is the creator of the channel. \n\nYou could also send messages to other users privately via **Direct messages** - including yourself!\n\nA user could create as many channels and add as many users as they want to in them. ': '## 频道\n\nRaven 帮助您与团队成员相互沟通。\n\n交流在**频道**中进行。\n\n所有可访问 Raven 的用户都可以在**开放**频道中查看和发送消息。\n\n**公开**频道对所有人可见，但只有成员才能在其中发送消息。任何用户都可以加入公开频道。\n\n**私有**频道仅对成员可见，新成员只能由频道管理员（即频道创建者）添加。\n\n您还可以通过**私信**与其他用户私下交流，甚至可以发给自己！\n\n每个用户都可以创建任意多个频道，并在其中添加任意多个用户。', '## Raven Settings\n\n\n<em>**Automatically adding users to Raven**</em>\n\nTo make it easy for you, the Raven User role is assigned to any user who has access to Desk. If you wish to turn this off, please head to Raven Settings.': '## Raven 设置\n\n\n<em>**自动将用户添加到 Raven**</em>\n\n为方便起见，所有可访问工作台的用户都会被自动分配 Raven 用户角色。如需关闭此功能，请前往 Raven 设置。', '### Access the web and mobile apps\n\n\nRaven is available at <a href="/raven">**/raven**</a> for both web and mobile. On mobile, Raven can be installed as a PWA.': '### 访问网页版和移动版\n\n\n网页版和移动版均可在<a href="/raven">**/raven**</a>访问 Raven。在手机上，可将 Raven 安装为 PWA 应用。', '% Complete must be between 0 and 100': '完成百分比必须在 0 到 100 之间', '% Cost Allocation': '成本分摊比例（%）', '% of Component Cost': '按原材料成本百分比', '%John%': '%张三%', "'Verification Link Expiry Duration' must be between 15 to 60 minutes.": '「验证链接有效时长」必须在 15 至 60 分钟之间。', '(Default: 1)': '（默认：1）', '(Empty)': '（空）', '(none)': '（无）', '(required)': '（必填）', '+ Add Price': '+ 添加价格', '1 attachment': '1 个附件', '1 channel': '1 个频道', '1 invoice': '1 张发票', '1 link blocked': '已屏蔽 1 个链接', '1 member added': '已添加 1 名成员', '1 member selected': '已选择 1 名成员', '1 Option': '1 个选项', '1 reply': '1 条回复', '1 site': '1 个站点', '1 vote': '1 票', '12 Hour (e.g. 2:00 PM)': '12 小时制（如下午 2:00）', '12-hour': '12 小时制', '128px × 128px PNG, SVG or GIF recommended.': '建议使用 128 × 128 像素的 PNG、SVG 或 GIF 图片。', '24 Hour (e.g. 14:00)': '24 小时制（如 14:00）', '24-hour': '24 小时制', "<b>Cannot create asset.</b><br><br>You're trying to create <b>{0} asset(s)</b> from {2} {3}.<br>However, only <b>{1} item(s)</b> were purchased and <b>{4} asset(s)</b> already exist against {5}.": '<b>无法创建资产。</b><br><br>您正尝试从{2} {3}创建<b>{0} 项资产</b>。<br>但只采购了<b>{1} 件物料</b>，且已有<b>{4} 项资产</b>关联{5}。', "<b>Row #{0}:</b> Bundle {1} in warehouse {2} has insufficient packed items:<br><div style='margin-top: 15px;'><ul style='line-height: 0.8;'>{3}</ul></div>": "<b>第 {0} 行：</b>仓库 {2} 中套件 {1} 的组成物料不足：<br><div style='margin-top: 15px;'><ul style='line-height: 0.8;'>{3}</ul></div>", '<div style="margin-bottom:10px; color: var(--gray-500) !important;">Define alternate units for this item. Eg: 1 Box = 12 Nos, set conversion factor as 12. (Will also apply for variants) <a href="https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/uom" target="_blank">Learn more &#8594;</a></div>': '<div style="margin-bottom:10px; color: var(--gray-500) !important;">为此物料定义辅助单位。例如：1 箱 = 12 个，换算系数设为 12。（同样适用于多规格物料）<a href="https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/uom" target="_blank">了解更多 &#8594;</a></div>', '<li>Packed Item {0}: Required {1}, Available {2}</li>': '<li>组成物料 {0}：需要 {1}，可用 {2}</li>', '<p><strong>Condition Examples:</strong></p>\n<pre>doc.status=="Open"<br>doc.due_date==nowdate()<br>doc.total &gt; 40000\n</pre>': '<p><strong>条件示例：</strong></p>\n<pre>doc.status=="Open"<br>doc.due_date==nowdate()<br>doc.total &gt; 40000\n</pre>', '<p><strong>{{ __("Condition Examples") }}:</strong></p>\n<pre><code class="language-python">doc.status=="Open"<br>doc.due_date==nowdate()<br>doc.total &gt; 40000\n</code></pre>\n': '<p><strong>{{ __("Condition Examples") }}：</strong></p>\n<pre><code class="language-python">doc.status=="Open"<br>doc.due_date==nowdate()<br>doc.total &gt; 40000\n</code></pre>', '<p><strong>{{ __("Condition Examples") }}:</strong></p>\n<pre>doc.status=="Open"<br>doc.due_date==nowdate()<br>doc.total &gt; 40000\n</pre>': '<p><strong>{{ __("Condition Examples") }}：</strong></p>\n<pre>doc.status=="Open"<br>doc.due_date==nowdate()<br>doc.total &gt; 40000\n</pre>', '<p>To disable the user from accessing Raven, go to "Users" and remove the "Raven User" role.</p>': '<p>如需禁止该用户访问 Raven，请前往“用户”，移除其“Raven 用户”角色。</p>', '<span class="h4"><b>Subcontracting Inward and Outward</b></span>': '<span class="h4"><b>外包收货与委外</b></span>', '<strong>Total qty</strong> of the rows (<strong>{0}</strong>) does not match the <strong>Qty to Fetch</strong> (<strong>{1}</strong>). Qty of the item will be changed to <strong>{0}</strong>. Are you sure want to proceed?': '各行<strong>合计数量</strong>（<strong>{0}</strong>）与<strong>待获取数量</strong>（<strong>{1}</strong>）不一致，物料数量将改为<strong>{0}</strong>。确定继续吗？', '[{0}] {1}:Financial Report Template': '【{0}】{1}', '`doctype` and `fieldname` are required for deleting property setters.': '删除属性设置时必须提供 `doctype` 与 `fieldname`。', 'A bot to handle accounts': '负责账务处理的机器人', 'A channel is created per department and employees are synced as members.': '为每个部门创建一个频道，并将员工同步为频道成员。', 'A channel with this name already exists in the target workspace': '目标工作区中已存在同名频道', 'A channel with this name already exists in this workspace.': '此工作区中已存在同名频道。', 'A disabled Product Bundle cannot be selected in transactions.': '已停用的套件不能在业务单据中选用。', 'A draft reverse journal for {0} has been created: {1}': '已为 {0} 创建冲销日记账凭证草稿：{1}', 'A few quick questions so we can set things up the way you work.': '回答几个简单问题，我们会按您的工作方式完成设置。', 'A fiscal year is required': '请选择会计年度', 'A folder cannot have a File URL': '文件夹不能有文件 URL', 'A group with this name already exists': '已存在同名分组', 'A Job Requisition already exists for {0} requested by {1} for the same department.<br> Do you want to continue?': '同一部门已有由 {1} 提出的 {0} 职位申请。<br>是否继续？', 'A lead sync source is already enabled for this Facebook Lead Form!': '此 Facebook 线索表单已启用了一个线索同步来源！', 'A little about you': '简单介绍一下您', 'A naming series conflict occurred while creating serial numbers. Please change the naming series for the item {0}.': '创建序列号时编号模板冲突，请修改物料 {0} 的编号模板。', 'A new fiscal year has been automatically created.': '已自动创建新的会计年度。', 'A new update is available.': '有新版本可用。', 'A new version of the app is available. Refresh to load it - some things may not work until you do.': '应用已有新版本。请刷新页面加载新版本，否则部分功能可能无法正常使用。', 'a open channel:':