rature, called nucleus sampling, where the model considers the results of the tokens with top_p probability mass. So 0.1 means only the tokens comprising the top 10% probability mass are considered.\n\nWe generally recommend altering this or temperature but not both.': '温度采样的一种替代方式，称为核采样：模型只考虑累计概率质量达到该值的词元。例如 0.1 表示只考虑累计概率前 10% 的词元。\n\n一般建议只调整此项或温度中的一项，不要同时调整。', 'An appointment booked through the portal can only be opened via email verification.': '通过门户提交的预约，只有完成邮箱验证后才能开启。', "An email will be sent to notify the User with the role 'Purchase Manager' when an automatic Material Request is created.": '自动生成物料需求时，将发邮件通知具有「采购经理」角色的用户。', 'An Error Occurred': '发生错误', 'An invite will be sent on their email.': '邀请将发送到对方的邮箱。', 'An SLA set as default cannot be disabled': '已设为默认的 SLA 不能停用', 'Analytical Accounting': '辅助核算', 'and add your site to get an API Key and API Secret.': '并添加您的站点，以获取 API 密钥和 API 私钥。', 'and then add them here.': '中创建函数，然后在此处添加。', 'and {0} more': '还有 {0} 项', 'Annual CTC': '年度人力总成本', 'Anonymous': '匿名', 'Anonymous poll': '匿名投票', "Another Budget record '{0}' already exists against {1} '{2}' and account '{3}' with overlapping fiscal years.": '预算记录「{0}」已存在，其{1}「{2}」与科目「{3}」相同且会计年度重叠。', 'Another CRM': '其它 CRM', 'Any': '不限', 'Any Channel': '任意频道', 'Any channel': '任意频道', "Any debit transaction with the keyword 'Bank Fee'.": '所有含关键字“银行手续费”的借方流水。', 'Any failed lead syncs will show up here': '同步失败的线索会显示在这里', 'Any source': '任意来源', 'Any type': '任意类型', 'Anyone': '任何人', 'Anyone can view but is not a member by default': '所有人都可以查看，但默认不是成员', 'Anyone from your organisation can join this channel and view its message history.': '组织内的任何人都可以加入此频道并查看其历史消息。', 'Anyone in the organization can view': '组织内任何人均可查看', 'Anyone with the link can view': '获得链接的任何人均可查看', 'AP Summary': '应付账款汇总表', 'API Configuration': 'API 配置', 'API Docs': 'API 文档', 'API Key / Bearer Token': 'API 密钥／持有者令牌', 'API Key cannot be more than 140 characters.': 'API 密钥不能超过 140 个字符。', 'API Method Path': 'API 方法路径', 'API Password': 'API 密码', 'API URL': 'API 地址', 'API Username': 'API 用户名', 'App name is required.': '请填写应用名称。', 'App that produced this notification; used to scope app-specific panels. Derived from the reference document when not set explicitly.': '产生此通知的应用，用于限定各应用专属面板的范围。未明确设置时，取自关联单据。', 'App {} is not installed': '应用 {} 未安装', 'Appearance': '外观', 'Append': '追加', 'Append Only': '仅追加', 'Append Rows': '追加行', 'Append Table': '追加数据表', 'Append this table with another table or query': '将另一个数据表或查询的行追加到此数据表', 'Applicable on POS Invoice': '适用于 POS 发票', 'Application Web Form Route': '申请网页表单路由', 'Applies to deposits': '适用于存入', 'Applies to withdrawals': '适用于支取', 'Applies to withdrawals and deposits': '适用于存入与支取', 'Apply a custom operation using python script': '使用 Python 脚本执行自定义操作', 'Apply discounts and margins on products': '对产品应用折扣与上浮', 'Apply User Permissions': '应用用户权限', 'Applying a Discount Amount? When this Sales Order is partially fulfilled through multiple Delivery Notes and Sales Invoices, the Discount Amount is allocated on a FIFO basis. The earlier transactions receive a larger share of the discount. To spread the discount proportionally across item prices, use Additional Discount Percentage instead.': '使用折扣金额？若此销售订单分多张销售出库与销售发票部分执行，折扣金额将按先进先出分摊，越早的单据分得的折扣越多。如需按物料价格比例分摊折扣，请改用额外折扣百分比。', 'Appointment Booking Portal Settings': '门户预约设置', 'Appointment can only be scheduled up to {0} day(s) in advance.': '最多只能提前 {0} 天预约。', 'Appointment cannot be scheduled for a past time.': '不能预约过去的时间。', 'Appointment cannot be scheduled on a holiday.': '不能预约在节假日。', 'Appointment Confirmed': '预约已确认', 'Appointment has been closed. Please book the appointment again.': '预约已关闭，请重新预约。', 'Appointment is already verified.': '预约已验证。', 'Appointment must be scheduled within the available slot timings.': '预约时间必须在可预约时段内。', 'Appointment Scheduling': '预约排程', 'Appointment Scheduling needs to be enabled for Appointment Booking through portal.': '须先启用预约排程，才能通过门户预约。', "Appointments created manually cannot have 'Unverified' status.": '手工创建的预约不能为「未核实」状态。', 'Apps Involved': '涉及的应用', 'AR Summary': '应收账款汇总表', 'Archive channel': '归档频道', 'Archiving': '正在归档', 'Are you sure you want to cancel this {} {}?': '确定要取消此{} {}吗？', 'Are you sure you want to clear demo data? This action cannot be undone.': '确定要清除演示数据吗？此操作无法撤销。', 'Are you sure you want to delete "{0}" view?': '确定要删除视图“{0}”吗？', 'Are you sure you want to delete the file': '确定要删除文件', 'Are you sure you want to delete this workspace? If you proceed, all channels, threads and messages within the workspace will be deleted. This action cannot be undone.': '确定要删除此工作区吗？继续操作后，工作区内的所有频道、话题和消息都将被删除。此操作无法撤销。', 'Are you sure you want to delete {0} - {1}?': '确定要删除 {0} - {1} 吗？', 'Are you sure you want to delete {0}?': '确定要删除 {0} 吗？', 'Are you sure you want to log out of your account?': '确定要退出登录吗？', 'Are you sure you want to relink this communication?': '确定要重新关联此沟通记录吗？', 'Are you sure you want to remove this tab and all its content?': '确定要移除此标签页及其全部内容吗？', 'Are you sure you want to resend the invitation?': '确定要重新发送邀请吗？', 'Are you sure you want to revise this budget? The current budget will be cancelled and a new draft will be created.': '确定要修订此预算吗？当前预算将被取消，并新建一份草稿。', 'Are you sure you want to unarchive ': '确定要取消归档', 'Are you sure you want to unmatch the voucher from this transaction?': '确定要取消该凭证与此流水的匹配吗？', 'Are you sure you want to unreconcile this transaction?': '确定要取消此流水的对账吗？', 'Array': '数组', 'as of {0}': '截至 {0}', 'asc': '升序', 'Ask a question and add options for people to vote on.': '提出一个问题并添加选项，供大家投票。', 'Asset Type': '资产类型', 'Assets Setup': '资产初始化', 'Assign condition is required': '请设置分配条件', 'Assign conditions are invalid': '分配条件无效', 'Assign To Me': '分配给我', 'Assignment Cleared Successfully': '已清除分配', 'Assignment Condition': '分配条件', 'Assignment conditions': '分配条件', 'Assignment conditions are invalid or corrupt, recreate the conditions.': '分配条件无效或已损坏，请重新创建条件。', 'Assignment Date: ': '分配日期：', 'Assignment Days are required': '请选择分配日', 'Assignment rule