n BOM. Uncheck for additional services like 'washing' used in manufacturing.": '物料清单中使用的原材料请勾选；生产中用到的附加服务（如「清洗」）请不要勾选。', 'Enable Frappe CRM Data Synchronization': '启用 Frappe CRM 数据同步', 'Enable Google APIs': '启用 Google API', 'Enable if a vendor manufactures this item for you. You can choose to provide them raw materials using the default BOM.': '由供应商为您加工此物料时勾选，可按默认物料清单向其提供原材料。', 'Enable if this item is a company asset like machinery or furniture.': '此物料是公司资产（如机器设备、家具）时勾选。', 'Enable if this item is provided by a customer and received via Stock Entry.': '此物料由客户提供、通过物料移动收货时勾选。', 'Enable Local LLM': '启用本地 LLM', 'Enable Loyalty Point Program': '启用积分方案', 'Enable Notifications': '开启通知', 'Enable OpenAI Services': '启用 OpenAI 服务', 'Enable Opportunity Creation from Contact Us': '允许从「联系我们」创建商机', 'Enable Parallel Reposting': '启用并行追溯调整', 'Enable party name/description fuzzy matching': '启用往来单位名称/摘要模糊匹配', 'Enable Permissions': '启用权限控制', 'Enable Quiet Hours': '启用免打扰时段', 'Enable quiet hours': '启用免打扰时段', 'Enable Sales Hierarchy': '启用销售层级', 'Enable Sales Hierarchy Permissions': '启用销售层级权限', 'Enable Security?': '启用安全校验？', 'Enable Separate Reposting for GL': '启用总账单独追溯调整', 'Enable Serial / Batch Bundle': '启用序列批次包', 'Enable Snapshot Reports': '启用快照报表', 'Enable stock reservation': '启用库存预留', 'Enable Stored Procedure Execution': '启用存储过程执行', 'Enable Subscription': '启用订阅', 'Enable Subscription tracking in invoice': '在发票中启用订阅跟踪', 'Enable the integration to create quotations and more in ERPNext.': '启用集成后，可在 ERPNext 中创建报价单等。', 'Enable the notification type before emailing it to users.': '请先启用该通知类型，再向用户发送邮件。', 'Enable this if you are experiencing issues with the new budget controller. Uses the older budget validation logic': '新版预算控制出现问题时启用，改用旧版预算校验逻辑', 'Enable this if you want the bot to be able to process files like Excel sheets or data from Insights.\n\nOpenAI Assistants run code in a sandboxed environment (on OpenAI servers) to do this.': '启用后，机器人可以处理 Excel 表格、Insights 数据之类的文件。\n\n此功能由 OpenAI 助手在沙盒环境中（OpenAI 服务器上）运行代码实现。', 'Enable this if you want the bot to be able to read PDF files and scan them.\n\nFile search enables the assistant with knowledge from files that you upload. Once a file is uploaded, the assistant automatically decides when to retrieve content based on user requests.': '启用后，机器人可以读取并扫描 PDF 文件。\n\n文件检索可让助手从您上传的文件中获取知识。文件上传后，助手会根据用户的请求自动决定何时检索文件内容。', 'Enable this if you want the bot to be able to read PDF files and scan them.\n\nFile search enables the assistant with knowledge from files that you upload.\nOnce a file is uploaded, the assistant automatically decides when to retrieve content based on user requests.': '启用后，机器人可以读取并扫描 PDF 文件。\n\n文件检索可让助手从您上传的文件中获取知识。\n文件上传后，助手会根据用户的请求自动决定何时检索文件内容。', 'Enable this option to permit the use of negative rates for items in sales transactions. This setting is useful for applying substantial discounts, processing refunds or returns, and handling special promotional pricing.': '启用后，销售单据中的物料允许使用负单价。适用于大额折扣、退款或退货以及特殊促销定价。', 'Enable this to block transactions where the selling price is less than the purchase or valuation rate': '启用后，售价低于采购价或成本价的业务单据将被阻止', 'Enable to make this supplier selectable as a transporter on Delivery Notes and Stock Entries': '勾选后，可在销售出库和物料移动中将该供应商选为物流公司', 'Enable to reserve a small sample from each batch for any analysis arising ahead': '勾选后，每个批次留存少量样品，供日后分析', 'Enable tracking sales commissions': '启用销售佣金跟踪', 'Enable Twilio integration to make and receive calls directly from your CRM': '启用 Twilio 集成，即可直接在 CRM 中拨打和接听电话', 'Enable Urchin Tracking Module parameters in Quotation, Sales Order, Sales Invoice, POS Invoice, Lead,  and Delivery Note.': '在报价单、销售订单、销售发票、POS 发票、线索和销售出库中启用 UTM 跟踪参数。', 'Enable UTM': '启用 UTM', 'Enabling email for {0} across all users in the background.': '正在后台为所有用户启用 {0} 的邮件通知。', 'Enabling this option prevents the creation of a new Sales Invoice when the customer has an overdue limit set and their outstanding overdue amount exceeds that limit.': '启用后，如客户设置了逾期额度且逾期未付金额超过该额度，将不能为其新建销售发票。', 'Enabling this will do the following:\n<ul style="padding-left:16px">\n<li>Make the rate column of all Packed/Bundle Items tables editable.</li>\n<li>Calculate the prices of all <a href="/desk/product-bundle" rel="noopener noreferrer">Product Bundles</a> in the Items table, based on the prices of its child Items, specified in the Packed/Bundle Items table. </li>\n</ul>\nNote: If this is enabled, updating the rate of the Product Bundle in the Items table will not change its price. It will get reset to the price based on its Child Items on saving the doc.': '启用后将：\n<ul style="padding-left:16px">\n<li>所有套件明细的单价列均可编辑。</li>\n<li>物料明细中所有<a href="/desk/product-bundle" rel="noopener noreferrer">套件</a>的价格，按套件明细中各子物料的价格计算。</li>\n</ul>\n注意：启用后，在物料明细中修改套件单价不会改变其价格，保存单据时会按子物料价格重置。', 'Enabling…': '正在启用……', 'Encoding': '编码', 'End date': '结束日期', 'End of Life:Item': '停用日期', 'End time': '结束时间', 'End time is required': '请填写结束时间', 'End time must be after start time': '结束时间必须晚于开始时间', 'End time must be after start time for: {0}': '以下工作日的结束时间必须晚于开始时间：{0}', 'ends with': '结尾为', 'Ends With': '结尾为', 'Ends with': '结尾为', 'Enqueue': '加入队列', 'Enter a description for this variable': '填写此变量的描述', 'Enter a valid phone number': '请输入有效的电话号码', 'Enter a valid time.': '请输入有效的时间。', 'Enter Access Key': '输入访问密钥', 'Enter Access Token': '输入访问令牌', 'Enter Brand Name': '输入品牌名称', 'Enter Company Details': '填写公司信息', 'Enter Exotel Number': '输入 Exotel 号码', 'Enter filename': '输入文件名', 'Enter filter label...': '输入筛选标签……', 'Enter Interview Type': '输入面试类型', 'Enter key behaviour': '回车键行为', 'Enter Personal Mobile Number': '输入个人手机号', 'Enter Source Name': '输入来源名称', 'Enter text': '输入文本', 'Enter the closing balance you see in your bank statement for {0} as of the {1}:Do MMM YYYY': '请输入 {0} 截至 {1} 银行对账单上的期末余额', 'Enter the credentials below and save.': '在下方填写凭据并保存。', "Enter the Item Code that this customer uses at their end. This will be shown in Sales Orders for the customer's reference.": '填写该客户自己使用的物料编码，会显示