iew': '文件视图', 'Filter and Sort': '筛选与排序', 'Filter based on {0}': '按{0}筛选', 'Filter by amount': '按金额筛选', 'Filter by source': '按来源筛选', 'Filter Icon': '筛选图标', 'Filter members': '筛选成员', 'Filter must be [field, operator, value]': '筛选条件须为 [字段, 运算符, 值] 格式', 'Filter must be a list or dict': '筛选条件须为列表或字典', 'Filter Rows': '筛选行', 'Filter rows based on columns or expressions': '按列或表达式筛选行', 'Filtering & sorting': '筛选与排序', 'Filters applied to Link queries and Attachment Gallery files.': '应用于链接字段查询和附件图库文件的筛选条件。', 'Filters must be four-value rows with string doctypes, fields, and operators.': '筛选条件每行须为四个值，且单据类型、字段与运算符须为字符串。', 'Finance': '财务', 'Financial Report Row': '财务报表行', 'Financial Report Template': '财务报表模板', 'Financial Report Template {0} is disabled': '财务报表模板 {0} 已停用', 'Financial Report Template {0} not found': '未找到财务报表模板 {0}', 'Find messages, files, links and polls. Type a query or pick a filter to start.': '查找消息、文件、链接和投票。输入关键词或选择筛选条件即可开始。', 'Fingerprint': '错误指纹', 'Fingerprint Stats': '错误指纹统计', 'Finished good quantity being consumed ({0} in stock UOM) must equal the quantity to disassemble ({1}). Do not change the UOM, conversion factor or quantity of the finished good row.': '消耗的成品件数量（按库存单位为 {0}）必须等于拆解数量（{1}）。请勿修改成品件行的单位、换算系数或数量。', 'Fire webhooks on specific events like when a message is sent or channel is created.': '在特定事件（如发送消息、创建频道）发生时触发网络钩子。', 'First Name is required': '请填写名字', 'First name must be less than 140 characters': '名字须少于 140 个字符', 'First Seen': '首次出现', 'First Used On': '首次使用时间', 'Fiscal Year (requires ERPNext to be installed)': '会计年度（需安装 ERPNext）', 'Fiscal Year Details': '会计年度详情', 'Fiscal Year does not exist': '会计年度不存在', 'Fiscal year must be a calendar year': '会计年度必须是自然年', 'Fiscal Year must be a calendar year from January 1 to December 31': '会计年度必须是 1 月 1 日至 12 月 31 日的自然年', 'Fiscal Year Start': '会计年度起始日', 'Fiscal Year {0} is not available for Company {1}.': '会计年度 {0} 不适用于公司 {1}。', 'float': '浮点数', 'Folder and item must belong to the same workbook': '文件夹与条目必须属于同一工作簿', 'Following up consistently': '持续跟进', 'For example, if set to 4, the system will try to find matching transactions in other banks 4 days before and after the transaction date. This is because transactions can clear on different days on different bank accounts.': '例如设为 4 时，系统会在交易日期前后 4 天内查找其他银行的匹配流水。这是因为同一笔交易在不同银行户头上的清算日期可能不同。', 'For example, if set to 4, the system will try to find matching transfer transactions in other banks 4 days before and after the transaction date. This is because transactions can clear on different days on different bank accounts.': '例如设为 4 时，系统会在交易日期前后 4 天内查找其他银行的匹配转账流水。这是因为同一笔交易在不同银行户头上的清算日期可能不同。', 'For example, you could schedule a reminder for a meeting to be sent to a channel every week.': '例如，可以设置每周向某个频道发送会议提醒。', 'For Job Card:Job Card': '所属生产任务单', 'For legacy serial nos, do not fetch incoming rate from serial no and calculate it based on the inward transaction': '对旧序列号，不从序列号取入库成本价，改按入库业务计算', 'For OpenAI: gpt-4o, gpt-4, etc. For Local LLM: use model name from /v1/models endpoint': 'OpenAI 可填 gpt-4o、gpt-4 等；本地 LLM 请填写 /v1/models 接口返回的模型名称', 'For operation {0} at row {1}, please add raw materials or set a BOM against it.': '第 {1} 行工序 {0} 请添加原材料或为其指定物料清单。', 'For PDF statements, we auto-detect the tables on each page. You can then confirm each detected table, map its columns, and exclude anything that is not transactions (e.g. ads or summaries). Password-protected PDFs are supported - the password is saved on the bank account and reused.': '对于 PDF 对账单，系统会自动识别每页的表格。您可以逐一确认识别出的表格、映射其列，并排除非流水内容（如广告或汇总）。支持带密码的 PDF，密码会保存在银行户头上供以后使用。', 'For project - {0}, update your status': '项目 {0}：请更新您的进度', 'For the item {0}, the consumed quantity should be {1} according to the BOM {2}.': '按物料清单 {2}，物料 {0} 的耗用数量应为 {1}。', 'Force Clear': '强制清账', 'Force Clear Voucher': '凭证强制清账', 'Force evaluate all': '全部强制重新匹配', 'Force re-evaluate all unreconciled transactions, even if they were previously evaluated': '对所有未对账流水强制重新匹配规则，包括之前已匹配过的', 'Force Refresh': '强制刷新', 