ication message': '在通知消息中隐藏单据预览', 'Hide If Zero': '为零时隐藏', 'Hide link preview': '隐藏链接预览', 'Hide Read Receipts': '隐藏已读回执', 'Hide this line if amount is zero': '金额为零时隐藏此行', 'Hide voter identities from other participants': '不向其他参与者显示投票人身份', 'high': '高', 'Highlight Cell': '突出显示单元格', 'Holiday List - {0} is not valid for current date.': '假期列表 {0} 不适用于当前日期。', 'Holiday List Assignment': '假期列表分配', 'Holiday List Assignment for {0} already exists for date {1}: {2}': '{0} 在 {1} 已有假期列表分配：{2}', 'Holiday List End': '假期列表结束日期', 'Holiday List Start': '假期列表开始日期', 'Holidays in this month': '本月节假日', 'Horizontal': '水平', 'How are you managing your sales today?': '您目前如何管理销售？', 'How big is the team?': '团队规模多大？', 'How do new leads usually come to you?': '新线索通常从哪里来？', 'How many options each person can select': '每人最多可选的选项数', 'How many people will use Frappe CRM?': '将有多少人使用 Frappe CRM？', 'How many units of the final product this BOM makes.': '此物料清单产出的成品数量。', 'How often should project be updated of Total Purchase Cost ?': '项目采购总成本多久更新一次？', 'How often should sales data be updated in Company/Project?': '公司/项目的销售数据多久更新一次？', 'How often?': '多久一次？', 'How this line gets its data': '此行的数据来源方式', 'How timestamps are shown in the activity timeline for all users': '活动时间线中时间戳对所有用户的显示方式', 'How to format and present values in the financial report (only if different from column fieldtype)': '此行数值在财务报表中的格式与显示方式（仅在与列的字段类型不同时设置）', 'HR Setup': '人事设置', 'HTTP Headers': 'HTTP 请求头', 'I understand, add conditions': '我已了解，添加条件', 'ID cannot be more than 140 characters.': 'ID 不能超过 140 个字符。', 'ID copied': 'ID 已复制', 'If a party cannot be matched by account number or IBAN, the system will try fuzzy matching using the party name and transaction description.': '如果无法按账号或 IBAN 匹配往来单位，系统会按往来单位名称和流水摘要进行模糊匹配。', 'If added, this prompt will only be shown when interacting with the bot': '填写后，此提示词只在与该机器人交互时显示', 'If checked, <i>Prepared Report</i> will not be enabled automatically on slow runs.': '勾选后，运行缓慢时不会自动启用<i>后台运行报表</i>。', 'If checked, a channel will be created in Raven for each department and employees will be synced with Raven Users.': '勾选后，将在 Raven 中为每个部门创建频道，并将员工同步为 Raven 用户。', 'If checked, journal entries made using bank reconciliation will be of type "Credit Card Entry"': '勾选后，通过银行对账生成的日记账凭证类型为「信用卡分录」', 'If checked, new messages will not show up in unread count': '勾选后，新消息不计入未读数', 'If checked, the document preview will not be attached to the notification message.': '勾选后，通知消息中不附带单据预览。', 'If checked, the entire amount (e.g. Freight) is allocated to the valuation of stock & asset items only. If unchecked, the amount is distributed across all items and the portion belonging to non-stock items is not added to valuation.': '勾选后，整笔金额（如运费）只分摊到库存物料和资产物料的成本价；不勾选则分摊到全部物料，属于非库存物料的部分不计入成本价。', 'If checked, the params will be passed as a JSON object instead of named parameters': '勾选后，参数将以 JSON 对象传递，而不是以命名参数传递', 'If checked, this prompt will be available to all users on Raven': '勾选后，Raven 上的所有用户都可使用此提示词', 'If checked, updates inventory; stock and accounting entries are created together. Leave unchecked if a Delivery Note is created separately.': '勾选后同时更新库存，库存与会计分录一并生成。如另行创建销售出库，请不要勾选。', 'If checked, updates inventory; stock and accounting entries are created together. Leave unchecked if a Purchase Receipt is created separately.': '勾选后同时更新库存，库存与会计分录一并生成。如另行创建采购入库，请不要勾选。', 'If enabled, a lead will be automatically created when an incoming email is received from an unknown contact.': '启用后，收到未知联系人的来信时将自动创建线索。', 'If enabled, a weekly scheduler scans the Stock Ledger Variance for item-warehouses with incorrect valuation in the current financial year and auto-creates Item & Warehouse based reposts to fix them.': '启用后，系统每周定时扫描本会计年度物料凭证差异报表中成本价有误的物料与仓库组合，并自动按物料与仓库创建追溯调整予以修正。', 'If enabled, all replies to your company (eg: replies@yourcompany.com) will come to this account. Note: Only one account can be default incoming.': '启用后，发给公司的所有回复（例如 replies@yourcompany.com）都会进入此账号。注意：只能有一个账号设为默认收件。', 'If enabled, emails will be pulled from this account.': '启用后，将从此账号拉取邮件。', 'If enabled, rule matching algorithm will run every hour': '启用后，规则匹配每小时运行一次', 'If enabled, sales from this item will be included in Sales Person and Sales Partner commission calculations': '启用后，此物料的销售额将计入业务员和销售伙伴的佣金计算', 'If enabled, stack traces of errors will be sent as messages by the bot ': '启用后，机器人会以消息形式发送错误的堆栈跟踪', "If enabled, stack traces of errors will be sent as messages by the bot during runs.\nThis is helpful when you're testing your bots and want to know where things are going wrong.": '启用后，机器人在运行时会以消息形式发送错误的堆栈跟踪。\n在测试机器人、想知道哪里出错时很有用。', 'If enabled, system will set incoming rate as zero for stand-alone credit notes with expired batch item.': '启用后，对含过期批次物料的独立红字发票，系统将入库成本价设为零。', "If enabled, the item rate won't adjust to the valuation rate during internal transfers, but accounting will still use the valuation rate. This will allow the user to specify a different rate for printing or taxation purposes.": '启用后，内部调拨时物料单价不随成本价调整，但会计核算仍使用成本价，以便为打印或计税指定不同的单价。', "If enabled, the message won't have a document preview": '启用后，消息不附带单据预览', 'If enabled, the Secondary Items generated against a Finished Good will also be added in the Stock Entry when delivering that Finished Good.': '启用后，按成品件生成的联副产品也会在该成品件出库时一并加入物料移动。', 'If enabled, the source and target warehouse in the Material Transfer Stock Entry must be different else an error will be thrown. If inventory dimensions are present, same source and target warehouse can be allowed but atleast any one of the inventory dimension fields must be different.': '启用后，直接调拨物料移动的发料仓与收料仓必须不同，否则报错。如有库存辅助核算，发料仓与收料仓可以相同，但至少有一个库存辅助核算字段必须不同。', 'If enabled, the system will allow negative stock entries for the batch. But, this may lead to incorrect valuation rates, so it is recommended to avoid using this option. The system will permit negative stock only when it is caused by backdated entries and will validate and block negative stock in all other cases.': '启用后，系统允许批次出现负库存。但这可能导致成本价不准确，建议不要使用此选项。系统只允许由补录单据造成的负库存，其他情况一律校验并阻止。', "If enabled, the system will allow negative stock entries for this batch, overriding the 'Allow negative stock for Batch' setting in Stock Settings. This may lead to incorrect valuation rates, so it is recommended to avoid using this option.": '启用后，此批次允许负库存，覆盖库存设置中的「允许批次负库存」设置。这可能导致成本价不准确，建议不要使用此选项。', 'If enabled, the system will allow users to edit the raw materials and their quantities in the Work Order. The system will not reset the quantities as per the BOM, if the user has changed them.': '启用后，用户可以修改生产工单中的原材料及其数量。用户改过的数量，系统不会再按物料清单重置。', 'If enabled, the web form can only be used with a <i>Key</i> from a corresponding <b>Web Form Request</b>.': '启用后，网页表单只能凭<i>密钥</i>使用，密钥须来自对应的<b>网页表单请求</b>。', "If enabled, this row's values will be displayed on financial charts": '启用后，此行数值将显示在财务图表中', 'If enabled, users must enter Serial No. / Batch data manually instead of using the selector dialog.': '启用后，用户须手动输入序列号/批次数据，而不使用选择器对话框。', 'If no Item Price is found for an item in the Price List set in the transaction, prices from the Default Price List will be fetched.': '业务单据所选价格表中找不到物料价格时，从默认价格表取价。', 'If not set, the integration uses the default project.': '未设置时，集成将使用默认项目。', 'If not set, the integration will use the default project': '未设置时，集成将使用默认项目', 'If party does not exist, create it using the Customer Name field.': '往来单位不存在时，按客户名称字段创建。', 'If party does not exist, create it using the Supplier Name field.': '往来单位不存在时，按供应商名称字段创建。', 'If rule matches, then:': '规则匹配后：', 'If set, accounting entries for this customer will post to these accounts instead of the company default.': '设置后，该客户的会计分录将记入这些科目，而不是公司默认科目。', 'If the reorder check is set at the Group warehouse level, the available quantity becomes the sum of the projected quantities of all its child warehouses.': '如果在组仓库级别做补货检查，可用数量为其下所有子仓库预计可用量之和。', 'If the user enables the mask property for the phone number field, the value will be displayed in a masked format (e.g., 811XXXXXXX).': '如果用户为电话号码字段启用掩码属性，该值将以掩码形式显示（如 811XXXXXXX）。', 'If the user has access to Employee and Report is enabled, they can view Employee-based reports.': '如果用户有员工的访问权限且启用了报表权限，即可查看基于员工的报表。', 'If this email is registered with us, a download link will be sent to it.': '如果该邮箱已在我们这里注册，下载链接将发送到该邮箱。', 'If unchecked, any workspace member can create a channel': '不勾选时，工作区的任何成员都可创建频道', 'If you did not request a password reset, please ignore this email. Your password will remain unchanged.': '如果您没有请求重设密码，请忽略本邮件，您的密码不会改变。', 'If you did not request this code, you can safely ignore this email.': '如果您没有请求此验证码，可放心忽略本邮件。', "If you didn't request this link, you can ignore this email. Someone may have entered your email address by mistake.": '如果您没有请求此链接，可忽略本邮件。可能有人误输入了您的邮箱地址。', 'If you later intend to make this private you will have to manually remove members that should not have access to this channel.': '如果之后打算将其设为私有，需要手动移除不应访问此频道的成员。', 'If you make this channel private, it will be visible to anyone who has joined the channel up until that point.': '如果将此频道设为私有，截至那时已加入频道的所有人仍可看到它。', "If you still want to proceed, please disable '{0}' checkbox.": '如仍要继续，请取消勾选「{0}」。', 'If you want this variable to have a default value, just add one option.': '如果希望此变量有默认值，只需添加一个选项。', 'If you want to run operations in parallel, keep the same sequence ID for them.': '要并行执行的工序，请设置相同的工序顺序号。', 'If your bank statement shows a different closing balance, it is because all transactions have not reconciled yet.': '如果银行对账单显示的期末余额与此不同，是因为还有流水尚未对账。', 'Ignore Account closing balance': '忽略科目期末余额', 'Ignore Tax Withholding Threshold': '忽略代扣税起扣额', 'Image carousel': '图片轮播', 'Image group layout': '图片组布局', 'Image Height': '图片高度', 'Image in the description has been removed. To disable this behavior, uncheck "{0}" in {1}.': '描述中的图片已移除。如不需要此处理，请在 {1} 中取消勾选「{0}」。', 'Image Width': '图片宽度', 'image_preview': '图片预览', 'Import 1 transaction': '导入 1 笔流水', 'Import Bank Statement': '导入银行对账单', 'Import Employees': '导入员工', 'Import Failed': '导入失败', 'Import fields from {0}': '从 {0} 导入字段', 'Import from Template': '从模板导入', 'Import Job': '导入任务', 'Import job has been queued': '导入任务已加入队列', 'Import my existing data': '导入我的现有数据', 'Import Query': '导入查询', 'Import queued. View Bank Statement Import {0} for completion status': '已加入后台导入队列，完成情况见银行对账单导入 {0}', 'Import Summary': '导入汇总', 'Import Table': '导入数据表', 'Import template should be of type .csv, .xlsx, .xls or .pdf': '导入文件须为 CSV、XLSX、XLS 或 PDF 格式', 'Import to Warehouse': '导入数据仓库', 'Import your bank statement to get started.': '导入银行对账单即可开始。', 'Import {0} transactions': '导入 {0} 笔流水', 'IMPORTANT: Create a backup before proceeding!': '重要：继续之前请先备份！', 'Imported': '已导入', 'Imported On': '导入时间', 'Imported {0} DocTypes': '已导入 {0} 个单据类型', 'Importing 1 transaction': '正在导入 1 笔流水', 'Importing Code Lists from remote URLs is not allowed.': '不允许从远程 URL 导入编码列表。', 'Importing {0} of {1} transactions': '正在导入第 {0} 笔，共 {1} 笔流水', 'Importing...': '正在导入……', 'in': '在', 'In 1 hour': '1 小时后', 'In 20 minutes': '20 分钟后', 'In 3 hours': '3 小时后', 'in a direct message': '在私信中', 'In a settings list, create a new record.': '在设置列表中新建一条记录。', 'In Minutes (min: 15 mins, max: 60 mins)': '单位：分钟（最少 15 分钟，最多 60 分钟）', 'In Process:Production Plan': '生产中', 'In Process:Work Order': '生产中', 'In the attachment viewer, or while hovering a gallery of images in a message.': '在附件查看器中，或鼠标悬停在消息中的一组图片上时。', 'In this case, the amount will be calculated as 25% of the transaction amount. If the transaction amount is 200, then this will be calculated as 200 * 0.25 = 50.': '此时金额按流水金额的 25% 计算。若流水金额为 200，则计算为 200 * 0.25 = 50。', 'in thread': '在话题中', 'In {0}, {1} is required in every row.': '{0} 中每一行都必须填写 {1}。', 'In {0}, {1} is required in row {2}.': '{0} 中第 {2} 行必须填写 {1}。', 'In {0}, {1} is required in rows {2}.': '{0} 中第 {2} 行必须填写 {1}。', 'In {0}, {1} is required in {2} rows.': '{0} 中有 {2} 行必须填写 {1}。', 'In-app notifications': '应用内通知', 'Include': '包含', 'Include in Charts': '在图表中显示', 'Include Returned Invoices (Stand-alone)': '包含独立退货发票', 'Include 