ld(s) that don't exist on {0}. This can't be undone.": '切换到 {0} 将移除 {1} 个在 {0} 中不存在的字段。此操作无法撤销。', 'Sync Data': '同步数据', 'Sync Data to Raven Cloud': '同步数据到 Raven 云', 'Sync From': '同步起始时间', 'Sync In Batches': '分批同步', 'Sync Mode': '同步模式', 'Sync Serial No Status': '同步序列号状态', 'Sync Strategy': '同步策略', 'Sync successful!': '同步成功！', 'Sync Successful, CRM Lead: {0}!': '同步成功，CRM 线索：{0}！', 'Sync tables from your data source to get started': '从数据源同步数据表即可开始', 'Sync Timeout (Seconds)': '同步超时（秒）', 'Sync your Contacts, Email and Calendars': '同步联系人、邮件和日历', 'Synced': '已同步', 'Syncing Data to Raven Cloud...': '正在同步数据到 Raven 云……', 'Syncing started in background': '已在后台开始同步', 'System Defaults': '系统默认值', 'System will use the latest saved Currency Exchange rate on or before the transaction date, however old it is. <br>\nUncheck to ignore rates older than Stale Days and fetch a fresh rate from the exchange rate provider instead.': '无论多旧，系统都会使用业务日期当天或之前最近保存的外币汇率。<br>\n取消勾选则忽略早于过期天数的汇率，改从汇率服务商获取最新汇率。', 'Table Imported': '数据表已导入', 'Table Label': '数据表标签', 'Table MultiSelect requires a Table with at least one Link field': '表-多选字段要求所选子表至少含一个链接字段', 'Table Name': '数据表名称', 'Table Restrictions': '数据表限制', 'Table {0}': '表格 {0}', 'Tables': '数据表', 'Tap a slot to change its emoji - these are your one-tap reactions.': '点按一个位置可更换表情，这些是您的一键表情回应。', 'Target workspace does not exist': '目标工作区不存在', 'Task id is required.': '请填写任务 ID。', 'Tax Expense': '所得税费用', 'Tax Identification': '纳税登记信息', 'Tax Row': '税费行', 'Tax Template': '税费模板', 'Tax withheld only for amount exceeding cumulative threshold': '仅对超过累计起扣额的部分代扣税款', 'Tax Withholding Entries': '代扣税款明细', 'Tax Withholding Entry': '代扣税款记录', 'Tax Withholding Group': '代扣税款组', 'Taxable Date': '计税日期', 'Taxable Document Name': '计税单据号', 'Taxable Document Type': '计税单据类型', 'Taxes:Item': '税率表', 'Taxes:Item Group': '税率表', 'Taxes:Sales Order': '税率表', 'Taxes and Charges Added:Purchase Invoice': '加计税费', 'Taxes and Charges Added:Purchase Order': '加计税费', 'Taxes and Charges Added:Purchase Receipt': '加计税费', 'TDS / withholding tax category applied when paying this supplier': '向该供应商付款时适用的 TDS/代扣税款类别', 'TDS/TCS is calculated at the rate defined here on every payment from this customer.': '此客户每次付款时，均按此处设置的税率计算 TDS/TCS。', 'Team Name': '团队名称', 'Team Permissions': '团队权限', 'Telegram API Token': 'Telegram API 令牌', 'Telegram Chat ID': 'Telegram 聊天 ID', 'Temperature': '温度', 'Template deleted successfully': '模板已删除', 'Temporal column used to detect rows that changed since the last sync. Use <b>modified</b> for mutable tables and <b>creation</b> for append-only tables.': '用于检测上次同步后有变动的行的时间列。可变数据表用 <b>modified</b>，仅追加的数据表用 <b>creation</b>。', 'Tenor API Key': 'Tenor API 密钥', 'Tenure': '任职管理', 'Test Connection': '测试连接', 'Text (with HTML)': '文本（含 HTML）', "Text displayed on the financial statement (e.g., 'Total Revenue', 'Cash and Cash Equivalents')": '在财务报表上显示的文字（如「营业收入合计」「现金及现金等价物」）', 'Text Rules': '文本规则', 'Thank you for reaching out to us. We will get back to you at the earliest.': '感谢您联系我们，我们会尽快回复您。', 'Thank you!': '谢谢！', 'That is you! No invite needed, you are already in.': '这是您本人！无需邀请，您已经在 Raven 中了。', 'The account type of {0} cannot be changed from {1} because stock ledger entries exist against it.': '{0} 已有物料凭证，科目类型不能再从 {1} 更改。', 'The amount format detected in the statement file. This is used to parse the deposit and withdrawal values from each row.': '从对账单文件中识别出的金额格式，用于解析每行的存入与支取金额。', 'The bank account is disabled. Please enable it': '该银行账户已停用，请先启用', 'The bank account is not a company account. Please select a company account': '该银行账户不是公司账户，请选择公司账户', 'The batch {0} is reserved for {1} in the warehouse {2} and the remaining quantity is not enough to cover the reservations. So, cannot proceed with the {3} {4}.': '批次 {0} 已在仓库 {2} 为 {1} 预留，剩余数量不足以满足预留，因此不能继续处理 {3} {4}。', 'The channel is already in this workspace': '该频道已在此工作区中', 'The closing balance {0} of the Stock Asset accounts does not match the closing value {1} of the Stock Balance report as on {2}. Resolve the difference using the Stock Ledger Variance report before closing the period.': '截至 {2}，库存资产科目的期末余额 {0} 与库存余额报表的期末金额 {1} 不符。请先用物料凭证差异报表处理差异，再进行期末结账。', 'The code interpreter tool is not available for the model {0}, hence it has been disabled.': '模型 {0} 不支持代码解释器工具，已自动停用。', 'The company of the employee (value in Employee DocType)': '员工所属公司（取自员工主数据）', 'The company {0} is not in South Africa. VAT Audit Report is only available for companies in South Africa.': '公司 {0} 不在南非。增值税审计报表只适用于南非的公司。', 'The company {0} is not in United Arab Emirates. UAE VAT 201 report is only available for companies in United Arab Emirates.': '公司 {0} 不在阿拉伯联合酋长国。阿联酋增值税 201 报表只适用于阿拉伯联合酋长国的公司。', 'The Company {0} of Sales Forecast {1} does not match with the Company {2} of Master Production Schedule {3}.': '销售预测 {1} 的公司 {0} 与主生产计划 {3} 的公司 {2} 不一致。', 'The completed quantity {0} of an operation {1} cannot be greater than the completed quantity {2} of a previous operation {3}.': '工序 {1} 的完工数量 {0} 不能大于上一道工序 {3} 的完工数量 {2}。', 'The completed quantity {0} of an operation {1} cannot be greater than the manufactured quantity {2} of a previous operation {3}. Submit the manufacturing entry for the operation {3} first.': '工序 {1} 的完工数量 {0} 不能大于上一道工序 {3} 的已生产数量 {2}。请先提交工序 {3} 的完工入库。', 'The cost of the secondary items cannot exceed the raw material cost of {0}.': '联副产品的成本不能超过原材料成本 {0}。', 'The current user language': '当前用户的语言', 'The date format detected in the statement file. This is used to parse the date values.': '从对账单文件中识别出的日期格式，用于解析日期值。', 'The date of the transaction': '流水的日期', 'The default company in the system': '系统中的默认公司', "The default value for the Check field {0} must be either '0' or '1'": '勾选框字段 {0} 的默认值只能是“0”或“1”', 'The department of the employee': '员工所属部门', 'The description of the transaction': '流水的摘要', 'The document has been created and reconciled. Uploading attachments...': '单据已创建并完成对账，正在上传附件……', 'The document type to send the notification for.': '要发送通知的单据类型。', 'The document you want this action to create.': '此操作要创建的单据。', 'The document you want this function to operate on.': '此函数要操作的单据。', 'The email button is enabled for the user in the document.': '单据中的邮件按钮对该用户可用。', 'The email of the user': '用户的邮箱', 'The end date must be in the future': '结束日期必须是将来的日期', 'The Excluded Fee is bigger than the Deposit it is deducted from.': '扣除的手续费大于其所扣自的存入金额。', 'The file search tool is not available for the model {0}, hence it has been disabled.': '模型 {0} 不支持文件检索工具，已自动停用。', 'The file should contain the following columns with a distinct header row. You can upload most bank statements as is without changing the columns.': '文件应包含以下各列，并有单独的表头行。大多数银行对账单无需调整列即可直接上传。', 'The file stays on this message and is also attached to the document you pick.': '文件会保留在此消息中，同时附加到您选择的单据上。', 'The final item that will be produced using this BOM.': '用此物料清单生产的最终物料。', 'The first name of the user': '用户的名字', "The fiscal year has been automatically created in a Disabled state to maintain consistency with the previous fiscal year's status.": '为与上一会计年度的状态保持一致，新会计年度已自动创建为停用状态。', 'The following account numbers are missing: {0}': '以下科目号在科目表中不存在：{0}', 'The following account numbers have no ledger accounts under them: {0}': '以下科目号下没有任何明细科目：{0}', 'The following cancelled repost entries exist for <b>{0}</b>:<br><br>{1}<br><br>Kindly delete these entries before continuing.': '<b>{0}</b> 存在以下已取消的重过账记录：<br><br>{1}<br><br>请先删除这些记录再继续。', 'The following code sample shows how to use the message action values in a {0}.': '以下代码示例演示如何在 {0} 中使用消息操作的值。', 'The following code samples show how to use the bot/agent in a Frappe app or Server Script.': '以下代码示例演示如何在 Frappe 应用或 Python 脚本中使用机器人/智能体。', 'The following payment schedule(s) already exist:\n{0}': '以下付款计划已存在：\n{0}', "The following people are on leave today and aren't in this channel: {0}": '以下人员今天休假，且不在此频道中：{0}', 'The following people are on leave today: {0}': '以下人员今天休假：{0}', "The following people aren't in this channel and won't be added to this thread: {0}": '以下人员不在此频道中，不会被加入此话题：{0}', "The following people aren't in this channel: {0}": '以下人员不在此频道中：{0}', 'The following Purchase Invoices are not submitted:': '以下采购发票尚未提交：', 'The following rows are duplicates:': '以下行重复：', 'The following rows are not valid fields of {0} and have to be removed: {1}': '以下行不是 {0} 的有效字段，必须移除：{1}', 'The following vouchers are not submitted: {0}': '以下凭证尚未提交：{0}', 'The frequency at which project progress and company transaction details will be updated. Set it to daily or monthly if you post a lot of transactions.': '项目进度与公司业务数据的更新频率。业务单据较多时，请设为每日或每月。', 'The full name of the user': '用户的全名', 'The ID of the employee': '员工 ID', 'The ID of the user': '用户 ID', 'The invoice is not fully allocated as there is a difference of {0}.': '发票尚未全额分配，差额为 {0}。', 'The Job Card {0} has only {1} left to produce, but this entry books {2} ({3} finished goods and {4} process loss). Cancel or update its other manufacture entries first.': '生产任务单 {0} 只剩 {1} 待生产，但本单登记了 {2}（成品 {3}，制程损耗 {4}）。请先取消或修改其其它完工入库单。', 'The last account row must not have any debit or credit amounts set.': '最后一行科目不能填写借方或贷方金额。', 'The message to send. Use Jinja tags to embed document data, e.g. {{ doc.employee_name }}': '要发送的消息。可使用 Jinja 标签嵌入单据数据，例如 {{ doc.employee_name }}', 'The model should be compatible with the OpenAI Assistants API. We recommend using models in the GPT-4 family for best results.': '模型须兼容 OpenAI 助手 API。建议使用 GPT-4 系列模型以获得最佳效果。', 'The new Raven web app only supports Raven Cloud. Switch to Raven Cloud and add your credentials to keep push notifications working.': '新版 Raven 网页应用只支持 Raven 云。请切换到 Raven 云并添加您的凭据，以保持推送通知正常工作。', 'The number of seconds until the request expires.': '请求超时前等待的秒数。', 'The opening balance might not match your bank statement. Would you like to reconcile them?': '期初余额可能与银行对账单不一致。要对这些流水进行对账吗？', 'The outstanding amount {0} in {1} is lesser than {2}. Updating the outstanding to this invoice.': '{1} 的未结金额 {0} 小于 {2}，将把未结金额更新到本发票。', 'The percentage by which you are allowed to order more on a Purchase Order than the quantity requested on the originating Material Request. For example, if the Material Request has 100 units and the allowance is 10%, you can order up to 110 units': '采购订单的订购数量可超过来源物料需求数量的百分比。例如物料需求为 100 个、许可为 10%，则最多可订购 110 个', 'The print button is enabled for the user in the document.': '单据中的打印按钮对该用户可用。', 'The processor has been created and is now available to use.': '处理器已创建，现在可以使用了。', 'The rate at which this item was last purchased via a Purchase Invoice. Auto-updated by the system.': '此物料最近一次通过采购发票采购的单价，由系统自动更新。', "The reasoning effort will be used to determine the depth of the reasoning process. This is only applicable for OpenAI's o-series models.": '推理强度用于决定推理过程的深度，仅适用于 OpenAI 的 o 系列模型。', 'The reference number of the transaction': '该笔流水的流水号', "The reminder's channel does not match its message.": '提醒所属的频道与其消息不符。', "The reminder's message does not belong to any channel.": '提醒对应的消息不属于任何频道。', 'The report may be too large to render in a single request. Narrow the filters and try again, or use Print and save as PDF from your browser.': '报表可能太大，无法在单次请求中生成。请缩小筛选范围后重试，或使用打印功能在浏览器中另存为 PDF。', 'The request could not be completed. Check your connection and try again.': '请求未能完成，请检查网络连接后重试。', 'The sell quantity is less than the total asset quantity. The remaining quantity will be split into a new asset. This action cannot be undone. <br><br><b>Do you want to continue?</b>': '出售数量小于资产总数量，剩余数量将拆分为一项新资产。此操作无法撤销。<br><br><b>是否继续？</b>', 'The site is in read-only mode right now. Please wait while the site is being updated.': '站点当前处于只读模式，正在更新，请稍候。', 'The Stock Closing Entry for {0} is not completed yet. Wait for it to complete before submitting the Period Closing Voucher.': '{0} 的库存结转分录尚未完成，请等其完成后再提交期末结账凭证。', "The stock for the item {0} in the {1} warehouse was negative on the {2}. You should create a positive entry {3} before the date {4} and time {5} to post the correct valuation rate. For more details, please read the <a href='https://docs.erpnext.com/docs/user/manual/en/stock-adjustment-cogs-with-negative-stock'>documentation<a>.": "物料 {0} 在仓库 {1} 的库存于 {2} 为负数。您应在 {4} {5} 之前创建正数入库单据 {3}，才能记入正确的成本价。详情请阅读<a href='https://docs.erpnext.com/docs/user/manual/en/stock-adjustment-cogs-with-negative-stock'>文档<a>。", 'The system found a mirror transaction ({0}) in another account with the same amount and date.': '系统在另一账户中找到一笔金额与日期都相同的对应流水（{0}）。', 'The system will attempt to automatically match a party to a bank transaction based on account number or IBAN.': '系统会按账号或 IBAN 自动为银行流水匹配往来单位。', 'The system will not generate link previews for these links if they appear in messages.': '消息中出现这些链接时，系统不会为其生成链接预览。', "The thread and all its replies will be permanently deleted for everyone. This can't be undone.": '此话题及其全部回复将对所有人永久删除。此操作无法撤销。', 'The uploaded file could not be parsed as a genericode XML document.': '上传的文件无法解析为 genericode XML 文档。', 'The user can create a new Item but cannot edit existing items.': '用户可新建物料，但不能编辑已有物料。', 'The user can delete Draft / Cancelled documents.': '用户可删除草稿或已取消的单据。', 'The user can export report data.': '用户可导出报表数据。', 'The user can import new records or update existing data for the document.': '用户可为该单据导入新记录或更新已有数据。', 'The user can select a Customer in Sales Order but cannot open the Customer master.': '用户可在销售订单中选择客户，但不能打开客户主数据。', 'The user can share document access with another user.': '用户可将单据访问权限分享给另一位用户。', 'The user can update a customer or any other fields in an existing Sales Order but cannot create a new Sales Order.': '用户可修改已有销售订单中的客户或其他任何字段，但不能新建销售订单。', 'The user can view Sales Invoices but cannot modify any field values in them.': '用户可查看销售发票，但不能修改其中任何字段的值。', 'The user you are trying to message is not a Raven User.': '您要发消息的用户不是 Raven 用户。', "The warehouse account(s) below are not of type 'Stock'. Please set a correct Stock asset account on the warehouse (Account Type must be 'Stock'):": '以下仓库科目的类型不是「库存」。请为仓库设置正确的库存资产科目（科目类型须为「库存」）：', 'The webhook will be triggered if this expression is true.': '此表达式为真时将触发网络钩子。', 'The webhook will trigger if the channel type equals the value selected here.': '频道类型等于此处所选值时将触发网络钩子。', "The withdrawal or deposit amounts - only required if there's no amount column.": '支取或存入金额，只在没有金额列时需要。', "The {0} prefix '{1}' already exists. Please change the Serial No Series, otherwise you will get a Duplicate Entry error.": '{0} 前缀「{1}」已存在。请修改序列号编号模板，否则会出现重复记录错误。', 'There are draft documents in this month': '本月存在草稿单据', 'There are multiple shifts assigned to the employee for the same period. Please mention the shift': '该员工在同一期间分配了多个班次，请指定班次', 'There are no accounting entries in the system for the selected account and dates.': '系统中没有所选科目与日期范围内的会计凭证。', 'There are no activities to display here. Go ahead and make some changes.': '这里还没有可显示的活动。去做些更改吧。', 'There are no entries in the system where the clearance date is before the posting date.': '系统中没有清账日期早于记账日期的凭证。', 'There are no new bank transactions to import': '没有可导入的新银行流水', 'There are no transactions in the system for the selected bank account and dates that match the filters.': '系统中没有所选银行账户与日期范围内符合筛选条件的流水。', 'There are no unread threads to show. Clear the filter to see all threads.': '没有未读话题。清除筛选条件即可查看全部话题。', 'There are only {0} options in {1}.': '{1} 中只有 {0} 个选项。', 'There are {0} unreconciled transactions before {1}.': '{1} 之前有 {0} 笔未对账的流水。', 'There is no Month End Closing to cancel for month {0}': '第 {0} 月没有可取消的月末结转', 'There is no one else in this workspace to add.': '此工作区中没有其他可添加的人员。', 'There is no Salary Structure assigned to {0}. First assign a Salary Structure.': '{0} 尚未分配薪资结构，请先分配薪资结构。', 'There is one unreconciled transaction before {0}.': '{0} 之前有 1 笔未对账的流水。', 'There was an error': '出错了', 'There was an error while evaluating the condition. Please fix your template.': '计算条件时出错，请修正模板。', 'There was an error while importing the bank statement.': '导入银行对账单时出错。', 'There was an error while performing the action.': '执行操作时出错。', 'There was an error.': '出错了。', "These fields aren't shown to users. Default values are used when the form is submitted.": '这些字段不向用户显示。提交表单时使用其默认值。', 'These work in the channel list, direct messages, threads and notifications.': '以下快捷键适用于频道列表、私信、话题和通知。', 'This action cannot be undone. This will permanently delete the emoji and it will no longer be available in reactions or messages.': '此操作无法撤销。此表情符号将被永久删除，之后无法再在表情回应或消息中使用。', 'This action is permanent and cannot be undone.': '此操作是永久性的，无法撤销。', 'This allows creation of sales orders from quotations that have passed their expiration date, providing flexibility in processing orders despite outdated quotes.': '允许用已过有效期的报价单创建销售订单，报价过期后仍可灵活处理订单。', 'This Bot will be used to send the message.': '将由此机器人发送消息。', 'This can be enabled at specific Item level as well': '也可在具体物料上单独启用', 'This can contain "CR"/"DR" values or positive/negative values. You could also have a separate column for CR/DR.': '此列可以是“CR”/“DR”标记，也可以是正负数值。也可以另设一列表示 CR/DR。', "This channel is archived. You can't send new messages.": '此频道已归档，无法发送新消息。', 'This channel is no longer available': '此频道已不可用', 'This channel type cannot be transferred': '此类型的频道不能转移', 'This column contains fields. Are you sure you want to remove it?': '此列包含字段。确定要移除吗？', 'This column is not available as a filter on this dashboard': '此列不能用作本仪表板的筛选条件', 'This direct message may have been removed or you don’t have access.': '此私信可能已被删除，或您没有访问权限。', 'This email was sent from {0}': '此邮件发自 {0}', 'This field is already added': '此字段已添加', 'This field is read only and cannot be edited.': '此字段为只读，不可编辑。', 'This field is required': '此字段为必填', 'This form isn’t published yet. Turn on Publish to make the link and embeds live.': '此表单尚未发布。开启“发布”后，链接和嵌入即可生效。', 'This FY': '本会计年度', 'This helps the bot to make less mistakes.': '这有助于减少机器人出错。', 'This is a formula based value.': '这是基于公式计算的值。', 'This is a snapshot report generated {0}.': '此为快照报表，生成于 {0}。', 'This is auto computed to balance the journal entry.': '此值自动计算，用于使日记账凭证借贷平衡。', 'This is how people will know what this channel is about.': '其他人会据此了解此频道的用途。', 'This is my first CRM': '这是我的第一个 CRM', 'This is not a valid formula. Check the variable used in the formula.': '公式无效，请检查公式中使用的变量。', 'This is required': '此项必填', 'This is the bank account entry. You cannot edit it.': '这是银行账户行，不能修改。', 'This is the header row. Click to mark the table as having no header.': '这是表头行。点击可将该表标记为无表头。', 'This is the last row. It will be auto populated based on the bank transaction.': '这是最后一行，将根据银行流水自动填充。', 'This is the row for the bank account. It will be auto populated based on the bank transaction.': '这是银行账户行，将根据银行流水自动填充。', 'This is used to describe what this function does to the AI Agent.': '用于向 AI 智能体说明此函数的作用。', 'This is used to describe what this variable is used for. A better description will help the AI Bot perform better.': '用于说明此变量的用途。描述越准确，AI 机器人的表现越好。', 'This is what the system expects the closing balance to be in your bank statement.': '这是系统推算的银行对账单期末余额。', "This Item is a Template and cannot be used in transactions.<br>All fields present in the 'Copy Fields to Variant' table in Item Variant Settings will be copied to its variant items.": '此物料是模板物料，不能用于业务单据。<br>物料多规格设置中「将字段复制到多规格物料」表里的所有字段都会复制到其多规格物料。', 'This Job Card has no raw materials to transfer.': '此生产任务单没有需要发料的原材料。', 'This link is valid for {0} minutes': '此链接 {0} 分钟内有效', 'This message has already been sent and cannot be edited.': '此消息已发送，无法编辑。', 'This message has already been sent.': '此消息已发送。', 'This message may have been deleted, or you may not have access to it.': '此消息可能已被删除，或您没有访问权限。', 'This message starts a thread': '此消息发起了一个话题', 'This message will be sent to {0} immediately.': '此消息将立即发送到 {0}。', 'This module is scheduled for deprecation and will be completely removed in version 17, please use <a href="https://frappe.io/helpdesk">Frappe Helpdesk</a> instead.': '此模块计划弃用，将在第 17 版中完全移除，请改用 <a href="https://frappe.io/helpdesk">Frappe Helpdesk</a>。', 'This name is reserved, please choose another': '此名称为保留名称，请另选一个', 'This needs to be unique and cannot contain spaces.': '必须唯一，且不能包含空格。', 'This one leads to a better Raven - help us climb by reporting the error on': '这一级阶梯通往更好的 Raven。帮我们再上一级，请将此错误报告到', 'This option is useful if you want to ensure a constant supply of raw materials/products and avoid shortage. A Material Request will be raised automatically when stock reached the re-order level defined in the Item form.': '此选项可确保原材料/产品持续供应、避免缺货。库存达到物料主数据中设定的重订货点时，将自动生成物料需求。', 'This Payment Entry is reconciled with {0}. Cancelling will automatically unreconcile it. Do you want to proceed?': '此收付款凭证已与 {0} 核销，取消将自动取消核销。是否继续？', 'This PDF is password protected. Please set the correct statement password on the Bank Account and try again.': '此 PDF 有密码保护。请在银行账户上设置正确的对账单密码后重试。', 'This poll is already closed': '此投票已结束', 'This poll is anonymous. You do not have permission to access the votes.': '此投票为匿名投票，您无权查看投票记录。', 'This poll is closed and no longer accepting votes': '此投票已结束，不再接受投票', 'This poll is closed and you can no longer retract your vote': '此投票已结束，无法再撤回您的投票', 'This poll is closed.': '此投票已结束。', 'This poll only allows one selection.': '此投票只能选择一项。', 'This poll will end on a future date.': '此投票将在以后的某个日期结束。', 'This poll will end today at {0}.': '此投票将于今天 {0} 结束。', 'This poll will end tomorrow at {0}.': '此投票将于明天 {0} 结束。', 'This processor will be used to process any documents, images, or PDFs uploaded to the thread and send its results to the agent for better context.': '上传到话题中的文档、图片或 PDF 都将由此处理器处理，并将结果发送给智能体，以提供更充分的上下文。', 'This reminder has already been delivered.': '此提醒已发出。', 'This report shows all entries in the system where the <strong>clearance date is before the posting date</strong> which is incorrect.': '此报表列出系统中所有<strong>清账日期早于记账日期</strong>的错误凭证。', 'This scheduled message will be permanently deleted.': '此定时消息将被永久删除。', 'This screen is not supported on mobile devices.': '此页面不支持移动设备。', 'This section contains fields. Are you sure you want to remove it?': '此区块包含字段。确定要移除吗？', 'This site sends push notifications through Frappe Cloud.': '此站点通过 Frappe 云发送推送通知。', 'This statement has already been imported.': '此对账单已导入。', 'This supplier will be auto-selected in new purchase transactions': '新建采购业务单据时将自动选择此供应商', "This thread is archived. You can't send new messages.": '此话题已归档，无法发送新消息。', 'This transaction has been reconciled with the following document(s):': '此流水已与以下单据对账：', 'This user already exists in Frappe. Add them to Raven?': '该用户已存在于 Frappe 中。是否将其添加到 Raven？', 'This user is already on Raven.': '该用户已在 Raven 中。', 'This verification link is invalid. Please book the appointment again.': '此验证链接无效，请重新预约。', 'This Web Form Request has already been used': '此网页表单请求已被使用', 'This Web Form Request has expired': '此网页表单请求已过期', 'This will automatically run transaction matching rules on unreconciled transactions every hour.': '将每小时对未对账的流水自动运行流水匹配规则。', 'This will be applied if no naming series is configured in Item master': '物料主数据未设置编号模板时使用此项', 'This will be auto-populated if not set.': '未填写时将自动填充。', "This will be removed for everyone in the conversation. This can't be undone.": '此消息将对会话中的所有人删除。此操作无法撤销。', 'This will delete all warehouse data for <b>{0}</b> and reset the sync bookmark. Are you sure?': '此操作将删除 <b>{0}</b> 在数据仓库中的全部数据并重置同步位点。确定继续吗？', 'This will just suggest creating a new entry, and will not automatically create it.': '仅建议新建凭证，不会自动创建。', 'This will permanently delete {0}.': '这将永久删除 {0}。', 'This will permanently remove the processor from your Google Cloud project. Any agents currently using this document processor will no longer be able to use it.': '这将从您的 Google 云项目中永久移除该处理器。正在使用此文档处理器的智能体将无法再使用它。', 'This will restore the demo data. Are you sure you want to continue?': '此操作将恢复演示数据。确定要继续吗？', 'This will update the warehouse and status of Serial Nos counted in {0} to match the stock ledger. Continue?': '将按物料凭证更新 {0} 中所统计序列号的仓库与状态。是否继续？', 'Thread': '话题', 'thread': '话题', 'Thread Bot': '话题机器人', 'Thread deleted': '话题已删除', 'Thread settings': '话题设置', 'Threads': '话题', 'Threshold Exemption': '未达起征额免扣', 'Thu': '周四', 'Thumbnail Hei