n issue/task from a message.': '用于添加自定义操作，例如根据消息创建问题或任务。', 'Use Website Favicon': '使用网站图标', 'Use your most-used emojis as quick reactions': '把最常用的表情符号设为快捷表情回应', 'Used for inter-company transactions': '用于公司间交易', 'Used to balance the books when recording expenses added to stock': '用于在记录计入库存的费用时平衡账目', 'Used to group messages on the frontend together': '用于在前端将消息归为一组', 'Used to pick the correct rate row inside the Tax Withholding Category for this supplier (e.g. Company vs Individual rates)': '用于在代扣税款类别中为该供应商选取正确的税率行（如公司税率与个人税率）', 'Used with Financial Report Template': '用于财务报表模板', 'Useful for extracting information from documents before sending it to agents': '适用于在把文档发送给智能体之前从中提取信息', 'User actions': '用户操作', 'User Added': '用户已添加', 'User added to hierarchy': '用户已加入层级', 'User added to Raven': '用户已添加到 Raven', 'User changed': '用户已切换', 'User Configuration': '用户配置', 'User Deleted': '用户已删除', "User don't have permissions to select/read this account.": '用户无权选择或读取此科目。', 'User has a role profile set. Please set the role to Raven User manually.': '该用户已设置岗位，请手动为其分配 Raven 用户角色。', 'User is already a member of the workspace': '该用户已是此工作区的成员', 'User is mandatory': '请选择用户', 'User is not a member of this channel': '该用户不是此频道的成员', 'User not allowed to synchronize data from Frappe CRM on ERPNext. Contact System Manager of ERPNext.': '用户无权从 Frappe CRM 向 ERPNext 同步数据。请联系 ERPNext 的系统管理员。', 'User Status': '用户状态', 'User {0} cannot be removed as it has a Role Profile assigned to it.': '用户 {0} 已分配岗位，不能移除。', 'User {0} does not exist in Raven.': '用户 {0} 在 Raven 中不存在。', 'User {0} has been removed from CRM roles.': '已移除用户 {0} 的 CRM 角色。', 'User {0} is already mapped to hierarchy node {1}.': '用户 {0} 已对应层级节点 {1}。', 'Users Added Successfully': '用户已添加', 'Users added to Raven will show up here.': '添加到 Raven 的用户会显示在这里。', 'Users can make manufacture entry against Job Cards': '用户可按生产任务单做完工入库', 'Users listed here can log into the customer portal to view their orders, invoices, and deliveries.': '此处列出的用户可登录客户门户，查看其订