visible_types fields for {0} must be a list': 'visible_types 中 {0} 的字段必须是列表', 'visible_types is not valid JSON: {0}': 'visible_types 不是有效的 JSON：{0}', 'visible_types must be a list': 'visible_types 必须是列表', 'Visit Frappe Support Portal': '访问 Frappe 支持门户', 'Vote Selection': '所选选项', 'Voters can select more than one option': '投票者可以选择多个选项', 'Votes': '票数', 'Voucher Created': '已新建凭证', 'Voucher Details': '凭证详情', 'Wait for it to finish. Deleting the lock file {} will not release the lock.': '请等待其完成。删除锁文件 {} 并不会释放锁。', 'Walk-ins': '上门客户', 'Warehouse data cleared': '数据仓库数据已清除', 'Warehouse Defaults': '仓库默认值', 'Warehouse is required to get producible FG Items': '获取可生产的成品需先指定仓库', 'Warehouse {0} does not exist': '仓库 {0} 不存在', 'Warn or stop if Item rate is changed in Delivery Notes and Sales Invoices generated from a Sales Order.': '由销售订单生成的销售出库与销售发票中物料单价被修改时，给出警告或禁止。', 'Warn or stop if Item rate is changed in Purchase Invoice or Purchase Receipt generated from a Purchase Order.': '由采购订单生成的采购发票或采购入库中物料单价被修改时，给出警告或禁止。', 'Warning: Account changed for warehouse': '警告：仓库的科目已更改', 'Warning: This action cannot be undone!': '警告：此操作不可撤销！', 'Warnings': '警告', "We can see {0} is made against {1}. If you want {1}'s outstanding to be updated, uncheck the '{2}' checkbox.": '检测到 {0} 是针对 {1} 开具的。如需更新 {1} 的未结金额，请取消勾选「{2}」。', 'We look forward to meeting you': '期待与您见面', 'We received a request to reset the password for your account. Click the button below to set a new password.': '我们收到了重设您账号密码的请求。请点击下方按钮设置新密码。', 'We support uploading CSV, XLSX, XLS and PDF files. Please make sure the file contains the correct columns.': '支持上传 CSV、XLSX、XLS 和 PDF 文件。请确保文件包含正确的列。', "We're unable to connect your call right now. Please try again later.": '暂时无法接通您的电话，请稍后再拨。', "We've auto-detected the details of the statement file.": '已自动识别对账单文件的详细信息。', "We've found 1 existing transaction in the system that conflicts with the transactions in the statement file. Are you sure you want to proceed with the import?": '系统中有 1 笔已有流水与对账单文件中的流水冲突。确定要继续导入吗？', "We've found 1 transaction in the statement file that will be imported into the system. Please review the details below and click the 'Import' button to proceed.": '对账单文件中有 1 笔流水将导入系统。请核对以下详情，然后点击「导入」按钮继续。', "We've found {0} existing transactions in the system that conflict with the transactions in the statement file. Are you sure you want to proceed with the import?": '系统中有 {0} 笔已有流水与对账单文件中的流水冲突。确定要继续导入吗？', 'Web': '网页版', 'Web Form Request': '网页表单请求', 'Web Form Request key is required': '必须提供网页表单请求密钥', 'Web Form Request link copied': '网页表单请求链接已复制', 'Web Form Values': '网页表单值', 'Webhook Data keys should be unique': '网络钩子数据的键必须唯一', 'Webhook deleted': '网络钩子已删除', 'Webhook Headers keys should be unique': '网络钩子请求头的键必须唯一', 'Webhook name already exists': '网络钩子名称已存在', 'Webhook secret is required': '请填写网络钩子密钥', 'Webhook secret should not exceed 140 characters': '网络钩子密钥不能超过 140 个字符', 'Webhook will trigger only if the message is sent by this user.': '仅当消息由此用户发送时才触发网络钩子。', 'Webhook will trigger only if the message is sent on this channel.': '仅当消息发送在此频道中时才触发网络钩子。', 'Webhooks': '网络钩子', 'Webhooks allow you to receive HTTP requests whenever a specific event occurs - like when a message is sent or a channel is created.': '网络钩子可以在特定事件发生时（例如发送消息或创建频道）向您发送 HTTP 请求。', 'Website forms': '网站表单', 'Wed': '周三', 'Week of the year': '年内周数', 'Week Starts On': '每周起始日', 'Welcome to Frappe CRM': '欢迎使用 Frappe CRM', 'Welcome! Please sign in to continue.': '欢迎！请登录后继续。', 'What are your biggest challenges with sales today?': '目前销售工作中最大的难题是什么？', 'What do you use today?': '您目前在用什么系统？', 'What Enter does can be changed in Preferences.': '回车键的作用可以在偏好设置中修改。', 'What is this channel about?': '此频道的用途是什么？', 'What is this workspace for?': '此工作区的用途是什么？', 'What kind of work do you do?': '您从事哪类工作？', 'What sampling temperature to use, between 0 and 2. Higher values like 0.8 will make the output more random, while lower values like 0.2 will make it more focused and deterministic.': '采样温度，取值 0 到 2。数值越高（如 0.8）输出越随机，数值越低（如 0.2）输出越集中、越确定。', 'What shows up in your Notifications tab': '决定哪些内容会出现在「通知」页签中', 'What the recipient receives by email when this notification fires. Mirrors Title/Description by default; set these to make the email differ from the in-app text.': '通知触发时接收人收到的邮件内容。默认与标题和描述相同；如需让邮件与站内通知的文字不同，请设置这些字段。', 'What will be deleted:': '将删除以下内容：', 'What would you like to accomplish first?': '您最想先完成哪件事？', 'What would you like to ask?': '您想问什么？', "What's your status?": '您现在的状态是？', 'WhatsApp Message': 'WhatsApp 消息', 'When': '提醒时间', 'When checked, only cumulative threshold will be applied': '勾选后，只按累计起扣额判断', 'When checked, only transaction threshold will be applied for transaction individually': '勾选后，只按单笔起扣额逐笔判断', 'When checked, the system will use the posting datetime of the document for naming the document instead of the creation datetime of the document.': '勾选后，系统将按单据的记账日期时间而非创建日期时间生成单据编号。', 'When enabled, it adds a cutoff date filter to Delivery Notes created in bulk from Sales Orders. This allows you to process orders only with a transaction date up to the specified cutoff date, which is useful for period-end processing and batch fulfillment.': '启用后，从销售订单批量创建销售出库时增加截止日期筛选条件，只处理业务日期不晚于截止日期的订单，适用于期末处理与批量发货。', 'When enabled, transactions with this supplier will be blocked based on the Hold Type below': '启用后，将按下方的临时冻结类型限制与该供应商的业务往来', "When images or PDFs are uploaded to the agent, Raven will automatically call Google Cloud APIs to parse the document and send it's results to the agent.": '当图片或 PDF 上传给智能体时，Raven 会自动调用 Google 云 API 解析文档，并将结果发送给智能体。', 'When images or PDFs are uploaded to the agent, Raven will automatically call Google Cloud APIs to process the document and send its results to the agent for better context.': '当图片或 PDF 上传给智能体时，Raven 会自动调用 Google 云 API 处理文档，并将结果发送给智能体，以提供更充分的上下文。', "When off, others won't see when you've read messages - and you won't be able to view read receipts on messages either.": '关闭后，其他人将看不到您是否已读消息，您也无法查看消息的已读回执。', "When there are multiple finished goods ({0}) in a Repack stock entry, the basic rate for all finished goods must be set manually. To set rate manually, enable the checkbox 'Set Basic Rate Manually' in the respective finished good row.": '重新包装的物料移动中有多个成品件（{0}）时，所有成品件的单价都必须手动设置。请在相应成品件行勾选「手动设置成本」。', 'When you delete a channel, all messages from this channel will be removed immediately.': '删除频道后，此频道中的所有消息将立即被移除。', 'When you leave this channel, you’ll no longer be able to see any of its messages. To rejoin, you’ll need to be invited.': '退出此频道后，您将无法再查看其中的任何消息。如需重新加入，需要有人邀请您。', 'When you leave this channel, you’ll no longer be able to send anymore messages, you will have to rejoin the channel to continue participation.': '退出此频道后，您将无法再发送消息；如需继续参与，须重新加入此频道。', 'Where do you want to send this?': '要发送到哪里？', 'Which agent should send this?': '由哪个智能体发送？', 'Who are you setting this up for?': '您是为谁设置本系统？', 'Who can find and join this channel': '谁可以找到并加入此频道', 'Who has read this message': '已读此消息的人', 'Who reacted to this message': '对此消息做了表情回应的人', 'Will be auto-populated': '将自动填充', 'WIP Work Orders': '在制生产工单', 'With the message box empty, open your last message for editing.': '消息框为空时，打开您的上一条消息进行编辑。', 'Withdrawal Header': '支取列表头', 'Withholding Date': '代扣日期', 'Withholding Document': '代扣单据', 'Withholding Document Name': '代扣单据编号', 'Withholding Document Type': '代扣单据类型', 'Within 1 day': '1 天内', 'Within 2 days': '2 天内', 'Within 3 days': '3 天内', 'Within 4 days': '4 天内', 'Within 5 days': '5 天内', 'Won Deals': '赢单商机', 'Work in Progress:Work Order Operation': '在制', 'Work Order Additional Item': '生产工单附加物料', 'Work Order Mismatch': '生产工单不一致', 'Work Order must reference a row in Production Plan {0}.': '生产工单必须对应生产计划 {0} 中的某一行。', 'Work Order must reference only one Production Plan row.': '生产工单只能对应生产计划中的一行。', 'Work Order Qty:Sales Order Item': '已开工单数量', 'Work Order Summary Report': '工单进度追踪表', 'Work Order {0} has no produced qty': '生产工单 {0} 没有已生产数量', 'Work Schedule & Holidays': '工作日程与假期', 'Workbook': '工作簿', 'Workbook Library': '工作簿库', 'Workbook template {0} does not exist': '工作簿模板 {0} 不存在', 'Workbook template {0} requires apps that are not installed: {1}': '工作簿模板 {0} 需要以下未安装的应用：{1}', 'Workbooks': '工作簿', 'Workflow updated': '工作流已更新', 'Working hours': '工作时间', 'Working Hours End': '工作结束时间', 'Working hours end': '工作结束时间', 'Working Hours Start': '工作开始时间', 'Working hours start': '工作开始时间', 'Workspace created': '工作区已创建', 'Workspace deleted': '工作区已删除', 'Workspace ID': '工作区 ID', 'Workspace is required': '请选择工作区', 'Workspace Logo': '工作区徽标', 'Workspace Members': '工作区成员', 'Workspace Name': '工作区名称', 'Workspace options': '工作区选项', 'Workspace renamed': '工作区已重命名', 'Workspace Type': '工作区类型', 'Workspaces allow you to organize your channels and teams.': '工作区可帮助您组织频道和团队。', 'Workspaces you can access will show up here.': '您有权访问的工作区会显示在这里。', 'World Map': '世界地图', 'Wrap text in double bars to hide it until clicked.': '用双竖线包住文字，可将其隐藏，点击后才显示。', 'Write Python code to fetch and transform data. Available globals:<br>• client: API client for the selected data source<br>• table: Write data to warehouse. Methods: insert(data, overwrite=False)<br>• state: Persist data between runs. Methods: get(key, default=None), set(key, value), delete(key), clear()<br>• secrets: Access secret keys. Methods: get(key)<br>• log(message): Log execution messages': '编写 Python 代码来获取和变换数据。可用的全局对象：<br>• client：所选数据源的 API 客户端<br>• table：将数据写入数据仓库。方法：insert(data, overwrite=False)<br>• state：在多次运行之间保留数据。方法：get(key, default=None)、set(key, value)、delete(key)、clear()<br>• secrets：访问密钥。方法：get(key)<br>• log(message)：记录执行消息', 'Writes': '可写入', 'Writing a message': '编写消息', 'Year in 2 digits': '两位年份', 'Year in 4 digits': '四位年份', 'Year-end Profit Transfer': '本年利润结转', 'Year-end Profit Transfer can only be created for December': '本年利润结转只能在 12 月生成', 'Year-end profit transfer is missing': '尚未做本年利润结转', 'Year-end profit transfer: loss for the year {0} transferred to Undistributed Profit': '本年利润结转：全年净亏损 {0} 转入未分配利润', 'Year-end profit transfer: profit f